<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">BAKA 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baka Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Baka 2</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bak 2</para>
  <para style="mt2">BAKA KUKŨ NYƆƆFA</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Baka Kukũ Nyɔɔfa nwu</char> lekple kuɔkyɛ sitũ kuɔkakatɛ di Israel batii sɛka nlekɔ nnyɔ sekofolaa suoto di nfũ di<char style="bk">Baka I</char> lese nii. Baafuo kukũ nwu ɔsɛ di akyuu anyɔ: (1) Sɛka nlekɔ nwu nnyɔ ɔlaa, diayɔ ni di alɛɛ kakpe alafa anaasĩ ntɛɛntɛɛ, fiɛ baalofo ni Yesu <char style="sc">BƆ </char> dialaadu ni Samaria lɛnɔɔ ku katoo kasɔ sɛka kalekɔ kayɛntɛkɔ di alɛɛ alafa akuɛnsĩ-afosi-anyɔ alɛɛ anyɔ kamɛ fiɛ baalofo ni Yesu <char style="sc">BƆ</char>; (2) Yuda sɛka kalekɔ ɔlaa, diayɔ ni di Israel sɛka kalekɔ dialaadu ni obe wɔ di Ɔka Nebukadnesar wɔ niakye ni Babel lafũ ni Yerusalem, baawɔɔsa nwu ni di alɛɛ alafa-anɔɔ-afosi-anɛ-akuɔ kamɛ fiɛ baalofo ni Yesu <char style="sc">BƆ</char>. Kukũ nwu lɛyɛntɛ ku Gadalia suoto ɔlaa fɛ kanyayilatɛ di Yuda diɛ Babel batii kalɔ osiɛ kamɛ ku Yuda Ɔka Yehoiakin odiki di leyo katenkɔ di Babel ɔlaa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amiina ya mmle lawa ta Israel ku Yuda baka ku batii onukwale ɔtanle oso. Yerusalem kawɔɔ ku Yuda batii kpinwu sɛlanle kamɛ osiɛ labla dikyi kplɛ ninwii di Israel batii sɛkofolaa kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niefũ ni leyooto di <char style="bk">Baka 2</char> ninle Elisa wɔ niawa ni di Eliya sɛmaa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛka kalekɔ nwu niasɛ nii 1.1-17.41</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Elisa nwu 1.1-8.15</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Yuda ku Israel baka nwu 8.16-17-4</para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Samaria ɔnɔɔ 17.5-41</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuda sɛka kalekɔ 18.1-25.30</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Diayɔ ni di Hesekia dialaadu ni Yosia 18.1-21.26</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Yosia sɛka ole 22.1-23.30</para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Yuda baka yɛntɛle 23.31-24.20</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Yerusalem ɔnɔɔ 25.1-30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya Ku Ɔka Ahasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Di Ahab kukpi sɛmaa, Moab lataka aayila di Israel suoto. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Ninfɛ di Ahasia lakpa aakye di fesre di leyo takale nɔɔ di Samaria, suoto nɔɔ lafũ nkɔ. Nioso aakpee batɔkyɛntɛ, aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikyɛ biɛlaakaalɛ Baal-Sebub, Ekron afiɔ nwu, aanyu nse kamataka di nkɔ be mmle lefũ ni suoto.”<verse eid="2KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ latɔkɔ Eliya, Tisbi otii nwu alɛ, “Kata fakyɛ faalaakyakako Samaria ɔka batɔkyɛntɛ nwu faakaalɛ ma falɛ, ‘Ta Yaa nnaa ni di Israel oso foofe falɛ fɔɔlaakaalɛ asaa di Ekron afiɔ, Baal-Sebub nfũ?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Flɔbataka di atensaa ya suoto fate nii. Kubio fabakpi!’ ” Nioso Eliya lakyɛ.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Obe wɔ di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lakple baasifi ni ɔka nfũ, aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Be oso bitookple biɛwa?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ onwii lawa aabakyakako wo, ni aatɔkɔ wo alɛ, ‘Bikple bitɔɔkyɛ biɛlaatɔkɔ ɔka wɔ niekpee ye ni kɔtɔ bilɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta Yaa nnaa ni di Israel oso fookpee batii falɛ balaakaalɛ asaa di Ekron afiɔ, Baal-Sebub nfũ? Nkpo oso flɔbataka di atensaa ya suoto fate nii. Kubio fabakpi!” ’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Ni di ɔka nwu lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔmɛn-suɔtɔ okle aale, aawa aabakyakako ye aatɔkɔ ye ɔlaa wɔ mmle?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Aale osuɔtɔ onwii niakpee ni sinwini akpeele, aatika ni kafɔɔ bɔkɛɛ kukũ ofiamɛ di ɔtɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Ni di ɔka nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Eliya, Tisbi otii nwu diale nɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakpee kakpɛ tunletɛ onwii ku batii afosi-anɔɔ baakyɛ Eliya nfũ nɛ. Kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu lakata aakyɛ Eliya wɔ niasiɛ ni di lekpenkpe nsintɛɛ, aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yaa otii, ɔka alɛ, ‘Soo fawa!’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Ni di Eliya latɔkɔ kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu alɛ, “Nse Yaa otii nle yi, ni ɔtɔ kukye osi kuwa kuɔbafiɛ afɔ ku batii afosi-anɔɔ lɛfɔ nwu!” Ninfɛ di ɔtɔ lakpa kuakye osi kuabafiɛ kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu ku batii nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Di nle mmle kamaa, ɔka lakple aakpee kakpɛ tunletɛ bamba ku batii afosi-anɔɔ baakyɛ Eliya ɔkyɛ. Ni di kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu latɔkɔ Eliya alɛ, “Yaa otii, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka nwu kobuɛ ni, alɛ, ‘Soo fawa wla!’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Ni di Eliya latɔkɔ kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu alɛ, “Nse Yaa otii nle yi, ni ɔtɔ kukye osi kuwa kuɔbafiɛ afɔ ku batii afosi-anɔɔ lɛfɔ nwu!” Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔtɔ nwu lakpa kuakye osi kuabafiɛ kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu ku batii afosi-anɔɔ nɔɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Nioso ɔka lakple aakpee kakpɛ tunletɛ tiɛfa ku batii afosi-anɔɔ. Kakpɛ tunletɛ tiɛfa wɔ mmle lakata aakyɛ aalaapɛ akunkyi nɔɔ di Eliya katũ aatikiti nwɔ lekoto alɛ, “Yaa otii, lekoto ta ɔlaa nii kunu fɔ kafutu ku batii afosi-anɔɔ ba mmle nkpa, bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ! <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Nyu, ɔtɔ ntɔɔkpa kuokye osi kuɔbafiɛ kakpɛ batunletɛ banyɔ kasale nwu ku batii lɛma. Kafɔɔ nunua ta ɔlaa nii kunu fɔ kafutu!”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Ni di SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ latɔkɔ Eliya alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ nwɔ, soo fakyɛ ku nnwɔɔ.” Nioso Eliya lataka aasoo ku kakpɛ tunletɛ nwu baakyɛ ɔka nwu nfũ.<verse eid="2KI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Ninfɛ di Eliya latɔkɔ ɔka nwu alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta Yaa nnaa ni di Israel ata fɔ alɛ faakaalɛ ni oso feekpee batii falɛ balaakaalɛ asaa di Ekron afiɔ, Baal-Sebub nfũ nɛ? Ta fatɔɔbla ni nle mmle oso yi, diidii flɔbataka di atensaa ya suoto fate nii. Kubio fabakpi!” <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Nioso ɔka nwu lakpi, ta SAATE nwu sɛlaa se kanya di Eliya lakakatɛ ni oso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:17">Ta Ahasia ditawɛ ni obisuɔtɔbi oso, Yoram niayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka, di Yuda ɔka Yehosafat obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoram lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Di Ahasia sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba simuu ku nle aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lakpaa Eliya Aasifiko Osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lamiɛ alɛ ɔɔkpaa ni Eliya di kakitikɔ kamɛ ansifiko ni osi yi, Eliya ku Elisa lakyɛ di osuku baakye Gilgal. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Ni di Eliya latɔkɔ Elisa alɛ, “Siɛ ninfũ; SAATE nwu lekpee mi kɔtɔ di Betel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Kafɔɔ Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa, namadiɛ fɔ.” Nioso baasoo baasifi Betel.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi di Betel ladie baabakaalɛ Elisa alɛ, “Faye falɛ SAATE nwu kamakpaa saate lɛfɔ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ansifiko miɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, n-ye, kafɔɔ bitambuɛ nwu ole.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Ninfɛ di Eliya latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Siɛ ninfũ, Elisa; SAATE nwu lekpee mi kɔtɔ di Yeriko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa, namadiɛ fɔ.” Nioso baasifi Yeriko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi di Yeriko ladie baabakaalɛ Elisa alɛ, “Faye falɛ SAATE nwu kamakpaa saate lɛfɔ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ansifiko miɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, n-ye, kafɔɔ bitambuɛ nwu ole.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Ninfɛ di Eliya latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Siɛ ninfũ; SAATE nwu lekpee mi kɔtɔ di Yordan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa, namadiɛ fɔ.” Nioso banyɔ lɛma baakyɛ baasifi.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ afosi-anɔɔ dikudi lakyɛ baalaayila di kakyonkɔ, baakyɔɔ anu lɛba le di Eliya ku Elisa layila ni di Yordan okle nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Ni di Eliya ladiki akpeele nɔɔ, aakakatu nya, ni aayɔ nya aapɛ di ntu nɛ. Ninfɛ di ntu nwu lasɛ diafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ku ɔmɛntukyɛ, ni di banyɔ lɛma nwu lawaalɛ di kasɔ kosole suoto baafe nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Obe wɔ baawaalɛ baaloo nii, Eliya latɔkɔ Elisa alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi, obe kafuo fɔ ɔbla ɔta fiɛ baakpaa mi mankyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Tɛɛ nwɛ ninwuna lɛfɔ nwu nkpo sɛnyɔ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Ninfɛ di Eliya ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛsaa siene fɛɛkaalɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ nse fɛɛnyɛɛ di obe wɔ bɔɔkpaa mi di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ mansifiko ni yi, ni kubale fɔ ole- nse diele nkpo flɔbawɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Obe wɔ bakyɛ bɔɔkakatɛ nii, nfanwu keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ɔtɔ ku bapɔnkɔ ɔtɔ ladie, ni kuablasa banyɔ lɛma nwu ntɛɛ, ni di Eliya lasifi osi di kakitikɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisa lanya nle mmle, ni aafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Teete nii! Teete nii! Israel bakeke ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ!” Ni di Elisa ditasinnyɔɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Elisa lamufũ akpeele nɔɔ amu aabɛbɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Ni aayɔ akpeele wua ya niakpa ni di Eliya suoto, ni aakple aasifi aalaayila di Yordan okle kotoko nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Ninfɛ aayɔ akpeele wua ya niakpa ni di Eliya suoto aapɛ di ntu nwu nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ nfɛ di SAATE, Eliya Yaa nwu nkpe nunua?” Obe wɔ aapɛ ni ntu nwu ku akpeele nwu, ni diasɛ diafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ku ɔmɛntukyɛ, ninfɛ di Elisa lawaalɛ aafe nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi nwu di Yeriko niatoonyu ni labuɛ alɛ, “Eliya ninwuna nwu ntika di Elisa suoto.” Ninfɛ baakyɛ baalaakyakako Elisa, baawakasɔ di anu nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Nyu, bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nkpe basuɔtɔ sientɛ afosi-anɔɔ. Ta ma bakyɛ baalaawolaa saate lɛfɔ. Loobia SAATE nwu Ninwuna lɛkpaa nwɔ ɛɛlaasiɛsa di kobokote kowo ee ɔtaata owo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bitankpee ma.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Kafɔɔ baanyinka nwɔ dialaase di obe wɔ di sinunsɔ lakpɛ nwɔ alɛ aasĩ nii. Nioso aabuɛ alɛ, “Bikpee ma.” Ni baakpee batii afosi-anɔɔ baalaawolaa nwɔ ayi atiɛ, kafɔɔ batanyɔɔ. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Obe wɔ baakple baawa ni Elisa nfũ, aasiɛ ni di Yeriko, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nintɔkɔ ye nlɛ bitankyɛ?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Sɛkpɛ Se Niabla Ni Ɔkpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu batii latɔkɔ Elisa alɛ, “Nyu, saate loo, okpoo wɔ nlɛ ote, fɛ mmle fɔɔnya nii. Kafɔɔ ntu nwu diɛlɛ, nioso kasɔ asaa dilɔɔlɛ atika abi.”<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Biyɔ lɛbɛɛsibii fɔle, biekpete mmba kaamɛ biwakoe.” Nioso baayɔ baawako nwɔ.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Ninfɛ aakyɛ ntu kataakɔ nwu aalaasa mmba nwu aakpete kaamɛ aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ntɔɔbla ntu be mmle klenkle. Diidii dilɔbasinta kukpi ee kasɔ nwu asaa asĩ abi otika.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Nioso ntu nwu lekple nwaa diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle, di ɔlaa wɔ di Elisa labuɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisa ladie di Yeriko aakata aasifi Betel. Obe wɔ akyɛ ni di osuku, bakosopo bawo ladie di okpoo nwu baabama nwɔ. Baabuɛ alɛ, “Kata fasifi, afɔ disifinile! Kata fasifi, afɔ disifinile!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Ni aamunikĩi aakyi aanyu ma, ni aakpaani ma di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di bakiti banyɔ ladie di lepoo baababɛbɛɛ bakosopo nwu afosi-ana-banyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Ni aasifi Kamel Kobokote osi, ninfɛ aadie ninfa aakple aasifi Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Di Israel Ku Moab Ntɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Yoram labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, di Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ. Yoram lale sɛka lefosi alɛɛ anyɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, kafɔɔ ditale fɛ mmle di ote ku ɔya labla nii. Aakpa Baal kasumu difuɔ le di ote lase nii. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Kafɔɔ atadiɛ nya ɔtɔ̀, ni aabla sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, aata alɛ Israel kafɔɔ labla sĩ nii.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Moab ɔka Mesa lase bafoso, ni aata Israel ɔka afosobi nkpe kɔlafa ku akunumuu nkpe kɔlafa sinwini nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Kafɔɔ di Ahab lakpi ni sɛmaa, Moab ɔka lataka di Israel ɔka suoto. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Nioso di obe nwu kamɛ Ɔka Yoram ladie di Samaria aalaasiisa Israel omuu. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Ni aata kafɔɔ Yuda ɔka Yehosafat kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Moab ɔka ntɔɔtaka di suoto nii. Fabatikankoe munaakpɛko Moab?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Ni di Yuda ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kamatikanko fɔ, nte fɛ mmle fate nii, batii nii fɛ batii lɛfɔ, bapɔnkɔ nii fɛ bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔmɛnsuku suoto bubadieko ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Ni di ɔka Yoram ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diefe ni di Edom Ɔfaafuu kamɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Nioso Israel ɔka ladie ku Yuda ɔka ku Edom ɔka. Baakyɛ baakyi, ni di ayi akuɛnsĩ kamaa, bakpɛtɛ nwu ditasinwɛ ntu baata suoto lɛma ee baata babɔkɛɛ ba di ɔkyɛ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Ni di Israel ɔka lafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Obeeye! Ɔlɛɛ ko di SAATE nwu lɛlɛɛ baka loo batiɛ nwu eesiisa alɛ ɔɔyɔ wo ankpee di Moab nnɛɛ?”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Kafɔɔ Yehosafat lakaalɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ, alɛ buawolaa ni kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ munkyeko ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka ɔnɔɔfotii onwii ladiki kanya alɛ, “Safat obisuɔtɔbi, Elisa nkpe ninfũ. Nnwɔɔ niatookpete ntu di Eliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliya omu kpɛmblatɛ aale</char></note> nnɛɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Ni di Yehosafat labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaa nkpe di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.” Nioso Israel ɔka ku Yehosafat ku Edom ɔka lasoo baakyɛ Elisa nfũ.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Obe mumbla munta baawo? Tɔɔkyɛ teefɔ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku yaafɔ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nfũ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Ni di Israel ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Oowo, diekye SAATE nwu nialɛɛ baka loo batiɛ aasiisa, aayɔ wo aakpee di Moab nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Ninfɛ di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ kosumu nii, ninanle fɛ dibu nkpe lɛta Yuda ɔka Yehosafat di anu nɔɔ yi, nse ntaanyu fɔ ee bia ntofo fɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Kafɔɔ kanunua wakoe kyitaapɛtɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:15">Obe wɔ di kyitaapɛtɛ latɔɔpɛ nii, SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ labatika di Elisa suoto, <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bibɛ sekplo biyiisa ɔtaata wɔ mmle. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni: Bilɔbanya kɔfɛɛfɔ ee kanto, kafɔɔ ɔtaata wɔ mmle kamayii ku ntu, ni aye, banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ bamba lee kamanyi ntu nwu. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Nle mmle nle lɛsaa le ninaa ni osie di SAATE nwu anu; abayɔ kafɔɔ Moab ankpee ye ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Bibalenkee okpoo kplɛ biala beetofo seyoyiɛ beekyisa ni ku okpoo finle biala. Bibabudi kowoso biene biala mintɛ kaasɔ, minsɔɔsa ntu ntaakɔ mmuu, minlalaasa kofe biene biala ku afuɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Kaleesɛ oyita, di obe wɔ kamɛ manta ni oleɔta yi, nnya mi ninfa- ntu niakye Edom lɛkyɛ diabiɛ diatoofe! Ni di kasɔ nwu layii ku ntu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Ninfɛ di Moab batii bamuu lanu alɛ baka ntɔɔwa ma ɔkpɛko nɛ; nioso baalɛɛ osuɔtɔ biala, babisɔ ku banɔɔfo, mba nikafuo ni akpɛsaa oklee, baalaayila di kɔmɛ kanya. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Obe wɔ baataka ni ku kolesɛtũ, baanya alɛ kufĩ latɔɔpɛ di ntu osi. Moab batii lanya ntu nwu di osuku nwu bɔmbɔ- fɛle ntɔ. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Ntɔ dile! Loo baka niɛkpɛ beeloloo bawo nɛ. Nunua kakpɛ kamɛ asaa nwu nfɛ nle Moab ale!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Kafɔɔ di Moab batii lawa ni Israel kasikɔ yi, ni di Israel batii lataka baakpɛ ma dialaase di obe wɔ baatoso nii. Ninfɛ di Israel batii labuo di kasɔ nwu baaloloo Moab batii nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Israel batii lawɔɔsa sekpoo nwu, osuɔtɔ biala kafɔɔ lafuki difuɔ aakpee di kofe biene biala kamɛ dialaase di obe wɔ kuatĩi nii. Baata ntu ntaakɔ nwu mmuu labudi, baabudi kafɔɔ kowoso biene biala. Kir Hareset okpoo lete niabu di afuɔ ninwu late nii. Kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ ba niaklee ni afuɔbi ya beenii ni sikũ lamana nwu baakyi ni baakpɛko nnwu kafɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Obe wɔ di Moab ɔka lanya alɛ batoolenkee nwɔ ni di kakpɛ nwu yi, ni aakpaa mpamii bakleetɛ alafa-akuɛnsĩ aakaasa di suoto nɔɔ alɛ bɔɔbɛ manfe di bakpɛtɛ nwu kamɛ mansifi Edom ɔka nfũ, kafɔɔ batafuo. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Ninfɛ di Moab ɔka lamufũ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kasale wɔ nikale ni ɔka sɛɛmaa nɔɔ, aayɔ aata oleɔta di okpoo kplɛ nwu oyoyiɛ suoto nɛ. Ni di ɔblɔ lawa di Israel suoto osie kanya; baadiɛ kakpɛ, baakple baasifi kasɔ lɛma kamu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa Lakyakaako Kpisɔfɔ Piitɛ Onwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Osuɔtɔ onwii di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi kamɛ ɔsɔfɔ lawi aalɛɛ Elisa alɛ, “Ɔsa nii wɔ ninle ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntookpi, faye kafɔɔ falɛ an-yɛkɛ SAATE nwu. Kafɔɔ kanunua otii wɔ asiko ni koto nfɛ kɔwa basuɔtɔbi nɔɔ banyɔ ɔkpaa fɛ balanle nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛ kafuo fɔ ɔkyakaako? Tɔkɔ mi, obe lɛsaa fakpe di leyo lɛfɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Ni di ɔsanko nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nnaa lɛsalɛsaa saa, diediki nnɔnyi kɛɛkɛɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Ninfɛ di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaakyi fakaalɛ bawo lɛfɔ bamuu baata fɔ ataase fukuti. Tankaalɛ kafuii lete. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Nni kamaa, buo leyo kamɛ faasɛɛ kokloo fakpee afɔ omu ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ banyɔ nwu. Faanyɛɛnɛ nnɔnyi nwu fakpete di ataase nwu amuu kamɛ, nse lewo ntooyii, kyisa ni fase di ɔlɔɔkɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Ninfɛ aadiɛ Elisa aalaasɛɛ kayoko aakpee nnwɔɔ omu ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nɛ. Baayɔ ataase nwu baawako nwɔ, ni aatookpete nnɔnyi nwu kaamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Obe wɔ di ataase nwu amuu ntooyii nii, ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, “Yɔ lɛbamba fawakoe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛtaase kuninwii diesimbu.” Ninfɛ di nnɔnyi nwu ladiɛ osoo nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ Yaa otii nwu nɛ, ni aatɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaasunsũ nnɔnyi nwu mmuu faayɔ fata ato lɛfɔ. Afɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ biyɔ nle niebu ni binyu suoto lee.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Ku Ɔsanko Saawɛntɛ Wɔ Niakye Ni Sunem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Dii ninwii Elisa lakyɛ Sunem. Ɔsanko onwii di kɔnɛɛ nkpe ni lawɛ ninfa, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ asiɛ aale alesaa nɛ. Nioso obe lele ɛɛkyɛ nfa, ansiɛ ninfa anle alesaa. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ ɔsa alɛ, “N-ye nlɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle ninwa ni ɔkyɛ loo nle Yaa otii klekle. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Ta butofo leyo biibii di lɛkya loo osi butɔɔ, buose mpa, opunu, lekpomii ku kandiɛ butɔɔ. Ni aasiɛ ninfa, obe lele ɛɛwa ɔkyɛ loo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Dii ninwii di Elisa lawa nii, aakata aakyɛ leyo nɔɔ nwu aalaate ninfa. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Ni aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Gehasi alɛ, “Lɛɛ Sunem ɔsanko nwu fatɛɛ.” Nioso aalɛɛ nwɔ, ni di ɔsanko nwu labayila di Elisa anu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ Gehasi alɛ, “Kaalɛ ɔsanko nwu falɛ, ‘Diobuo fɔ ta awo oso. Nunua be lɛsaa buɔbla buta fɔ? Buafuo ɔka ee kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ ɔkakatɛko di disi lɛfɔ?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Ni di ɔsanko nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nkpe leyo di batii nii bamu kamɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Ninfɛ di Elisa lakaalɛ alɛ, “Be nfɛ baafuo nwɔ ɔbla ɔta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Ni di Gehasi labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako, anaa obisuɔtɔbi kuonwii, ɔsa nɔɔ kafɔɔ ntoobe.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Ninfɛ di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛɛ ɔsanko nwu.” Nioso aalɛɛ ɔsanko nwu, ni aabaayila di kayoko kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛlɛɛmba nuakpa okle, fabaklee obisuɔtɔbi di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Ni aasĩ aabuɛ alɛ, “Oowo, saate nii, Yaa otii! Tankyɔnkyɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Kafɔɔ ɔsanko nwu labalaka lɛmɛ, ni di lɛlɛɛ le niakyi diawa ni di obe nwu tutuutu kamɛ ɔsanko nwu lalofo obisuɔtɔbi, fɛ mmle di Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Obisɔ nwu labamuɔ, dii ninwii aadie aakyɛ ote nfũ, di bafiɛlɛtɛ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Ni di obisɔ nwu latɔkɔ ote alɛ, “Letoole nii! Letoole nii!” Ninfɛ di ote latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ onwii alɛ, “Kpaa nwɔ fakyɛnko ɔya.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Di kpɛmblatɛ nwu lakpaa nwɔ aakyɛnko ni ɔya kamaa, osuɔtɔbi nwu latika di nkpaa nɔɔ diaadu kakũ, ni aakpi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu lakata aalaayɔ obisɔ nwu aatika di Yaa otii nwu mpa suoto, ni aasɛɛ kayoko aadie nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Ni aalɛɛ ɔsa aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Lekoto kyesee mi kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ onwii ku bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo onwii ninkyɛ Yaa otii nwu nfũ wla ninkple nwa.”<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Ni di ɔsa lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Be oso fɔɔkyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ miɛ? Diele Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle kule ee Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi dile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Ni di ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Nnwu kulɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lata baatakatɛsa nwɔ baasiɛsaa di bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, ni aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Sɔ buosifi; tankyɛnkoe buɛɛ dilaase di obe wɔ lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Nioso aadie aawa Yaa otii nwu nfũ di Karmel Kobokote.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Obe wɔ di Yaa otii nwu lanya ni ɔsanko nwu kaakyonkɔ, ni di osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Gehasi alɛ, “Nyu lo! Nnya Sunem ɔsanko nwu! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Toso falaakyakako nwɔ, faakaalɛ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Sikpe fɔ osie? Sikpe ɔsa lɛfɔ osie? Sikpe obi lɛfɔ osie?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Ɔsanko nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛsaa biala nlɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Obe wɔ di ɔsanko nwu ladu ni Yaa otii nwu nfũ di kobokote osi, ni aawakasɔ aamufũ nwɔ ninkpaa nɛ. Ni di Gehasi labatukusa ɔsanko nwu nɛ. Kafɔɔ Yaa otii nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Diɛ nwɔ! Asi di nimiina siene kamɛ, kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lɛyɔ ni eewofasa mi, aatɔkɔ mi kafɔɔ lɛsaa le oso ɛɛbla ni nkpo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Saate nii, lɛkaalɛ fɔ obi? Ntatɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ, ‘Tankyɔnkyɔ mi’?”<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ Gehasi alɛ, “Yɔ akpeele wua lɛfɔ fakpee, faatika ofiamɛ lɛfɔ, faayɔ ɔkyɛnwoso nii di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ faatoso. Otii lele fɛɛkyakako, tansɛɛsɔɔ. Otii lele kafɔɔ niɛsɛɛsa fɔ, tantuna. Yɔ ɔkyɛnwoso nii nwu fatika di osuɔtɔbi nwu anu.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Kafɔɔ obisɔ nwu ɔya labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, di afɔɔ fakpe ni nkpa, namadiɛ fɔ.” Nioso Elisa lataka aatikanko ɔsanko nwu.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehasi lale katũ aalaayɔ ɔkyɛnwoso nwu aalaatika di obisɔ nwu anu, kafɔɔ atakpanko suoto ee atuna. Nioso Gehasi lakple aasifi aalaakyakako Elisa aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Osuɔtɔbi nwu diɛsɛnkɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Di Elisa labuo ni leyo, aanya obisɔ nwu lekpi ate di atensaa nɔɔ suoto ninfa. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Ni di Elisa labuo kamɛ, aasɛɛ kokloo aakpee banyɔ lɛma nwu, ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Ninfɛ di Elisa lafuu di obisɔ nwu suoto di mpa suoto nɛ. Aayɔ kanya nɔɔ aase di kanya nɔɔ, anu nɔɔ di anu nɔɔ, nnɛɛ nɔɔ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ. Aananfi ni suoto nɔɔ aatika nwɔ ni di suoto yi, obisɔ nwu lafila. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Ninfɛ di Elisa lataka aakyɛ aatoofenfe di leyo nwu kamɛ, aakple aalaafuu nwɔ di suoto di mpa nwu nɛ. Nfanwu osuɔtɔbi nwu niasiɛntɛ sikuɛnsĩ ni aatikiti anu nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Ninfɛ di Elisa lalɛɛ Gehasi aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Lɛɛ Sunem ɔsanko nwu fatɛɛ.” Ni aalɛɛ nwɔ nɛ. Di ɔsanko nwu lawa nii, Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kpaa obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Ɔsanko nwu labuo leyo, ni aawakasɔ aamufũ Elisa nkpaa aase katũ kaasɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lakpaa obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aadieko nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Lakple Aabla Ɛkpɛ Ɛnyɔ Be Niabla Ni Ɔkpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Ni di Elisa lakple aasifi Gilgal di kɔka latɔɔkpɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ. Obe wɔ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ latookpee ni asi baawo ku nnwɔɔ yi, ni aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Yɔ dibukii kplɛ fatika di ɔtɔ faawa alesaa awo fata basuɔtɔ ba mmle.”<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Onwii lɛma ladie aakyɛ kofe alɛ ɔɔlaamiɛ sɛfa anwako, ni aanya lepoo kamɛ awosobi nɛ. Ni aatɛsɛ akuuku awo aayiisa akpeele wua nɔɔ kamɛ aawako nɛ. Aayie nii, aabɛbɛɛ nya aakpete di alesaa dibukii nwu kamɛ, nu di otii kuonwii ditatofo lɛsaa le diale nii. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Ni aadiki alesaa nwu aase basuɔtɔ nwu nɛ. Kafɔɔ baakyako ni alesaa nwu ole, ni baafaa baabuɛ alɛ, “O Yaa otii, kukpi nsi di dibukii nwu kamɛ!” Nkpo oso batafuo nya ole.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Bitɛɛ nnaafũ nwo.” Ni aayɔ aakpete di dibukii nwu kamɛ aabuɛ alɛ, “Bisɛ nya bita batii nwu baale.” Ni di lɛsaakpile kuninwii ditasinsiɛ di dibukii nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Osuɔtɔ onwii lakye Baal Salisa aawa, aawako Yaa otii nwu bloblo akudi afosi-anyɔ baayɔ akpaa kosole kasale baafiɛ nii ku atitabi fɔle bakotoku bawo. Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Yɔ nya fata batii nwu bale”.<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ninfɛ di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛ nfɛ kayɔ n-ya mmle nse batii kɔlafa ba mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Kafɔɔ Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yɔ nya fata batii nwu bale. Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Babale, awo nkple ambu kafɔɔ.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Ninfɛ aayɔ aase ma nɛ. Ni baale, awo lakple aabu, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Baakya Naaman Ɔfiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Naaman lale kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ di Siria ɔka bakpɛtɛ kamɛ. Aale otii kplɛ di saate nɔɔ anu, baatɔɔ dibu nwaa, diekye SAATE nwu lata Siria lelenkee diafe ni di suoto nɔɔ. Aale kpɛtɛ sientɛ, kafɔɔ aatɔɔfiɛ ɔfiɛ sɛɛle.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Di obe onwii kamɛ, Siria batii lakyɛ baalaamufũ okpeele sɛlanle di Israel, ni aatoosumu Naaman ɔsɔfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Ni di okpeele nwu latɔkɔ saate-sanko nɔɔ alɛ, “Nse fɛle saate nii kamakyɛ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ ninkpe ni di Samaria nfũ! Nse atabakya nwɔ ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nɔɔ nwu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Ni di Naaman lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ saate nɔɔ ɔlaa wɔ di ɔsankobi nwu niakye ni Israel labuɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Ninfɛ di Siria ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Dikpe nii fɛɛkyɛ, kamata Israel ɔka kukũ.” Nioso Naaman lasifi, aaklee koto fututu onutũ bakilo alafa atiɛ-afosi-ana, koto sɛɛle bakilo afosi-akuɛnsĩ ku abula sɛkpa lefosi. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Kukũ ko aaklee aakyɛnko ni Israel ɔka labuɛ alɛ: “Di kukũ ko mmle kanya, lekpee kpɛmblatɛ nii Naaman ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ nlɛ kya nwɔ ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nɔɔ nwu.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Di Israel ɔka lakaɔka kukũ nwu, ni aabɛbɛɛ akpeele wua nɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Yaa nle? Kafuo otii olo, nkple nsɛnkɛsɔɔ? Be oso di otii wɔ mmle nkpee mi otii alɛ nkya nwɔ ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nɔɔ? Nyu mmle oomiɛ alɛ adieko mi ni kalɔ̀!”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Obe wɔ di Elisa, Yaa otii nwu lanu alɛ Israel ɔka ntɔɔbɛbɛɛ ni akpeele wua nɔɔ yi, ni aatɔɔ kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Be oso fɛɛbɛbɛɛ akpeele wua lɛfɔ? Ta osuɔtɔ nwu awa ɔkyɛ nii, ni abatofo alɛ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nkpe di Israel.” <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Nioso Naaman lasifi ku bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii, baalaayila di Elisa leyo kayoko. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Ni di Elisa lakpee tɛkyɛntɛ aalaatɔkɔ Naaman alɛ, “Tɔkyɛ faalaafoto suoto lɛfɔ sikuɛnsĩ di Yordan okle kamɛ, nse suoto lɛfɔ ntookple di akpa ninsĩ, ni fababla klekle.”<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Kafɔɔ Naaman lasifi ku ɔblɔ ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Ami lanyu nlɛ, nwaako abadie anwa ɔkyɛ nii amayila anlɛɛ <char style="nd">Saate,</char> Yaa nɔɔ leyooto, anlɔlɔfɔ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di aba nwu suoto, ankya mi ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nii nwu. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Sɛɛ Abana ku Farpar sekle di Damasko diɛlɛ silenke Israel ntu biala? Naafuo mi okpe di suoto nii sibla klekle?” Nioso aamunikĩi aasifi ku ɔblɔ.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Ni di Naaman bakpɛmblatɛ lakyɛ baalaakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Teete nii, nse fɛ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu ntɔkɔ fɔ alɛ bla lɛsaa kplɛ lewo, nse faabla ni? Ni lɛ nfɛ, nse ɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ alɛ, ‘Foto suoto faaklekle’?” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Nioso aasoo aakyɛ aalaakpee suoto nɔɔ di Yordan okle sikuɛnsĩ, fɛ mmle di Yaa otii nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ nii. Ni di suoto nɔɔ lakple di akpa ninsĩ, siabla klekle fɛle okosopo suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Ninfɛ di Naaman ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bamuu lakple baasifi Yaa otii nwu nfũ nɛ. Ni di Naaman layila di Elisa anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Kanunua nfɛ n-ye nlɛ Yaa nnaa di kayi kamuu kamɛ, diediki di Israel lete. Lekoto nunua, fũ akyɛsaa ya mmle di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ɔkyɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ kosumu nii, namafũ lɛsaa kuninwii.” Bia nu di Naaman lanyinka nwɔ yi, aasĩ.<verse eid="2KI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Ninfɛ di Naaman labuɛ alɛ, “Nse floofũ yi, ni lekoto, ta ami, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ akusii kɔtɛ, fɛ mmle kanya di bapɔnkɔ banyɔ kafuo ni otuka. Diekye diidii kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ dilɔbasinta ofiɛ asaaɔta ee oleɔta kuonwii ata yaa bamba kuonwii, kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lete. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ayɔ lɛsaa le mmle ninwii akyɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ: Nse saate nii lebuo Rimon kafiofa alɛ ɔɔwakasɔ aanta nya, ni ɛɛkpɛ di kɔnɛɛ nii suoto, di ami kafɔɔ lɛwakasɔ ninfa- nse lɛwakasɔ di Rimon kafiofa yi, ni SAATE nwu ayɔ nle mmle akyɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ Naaman alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Nni kamaa, di Naaman lakyɛ ni lɛkɔ kɛɛkɛ, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />ni di Elisa, Yaa otii nwu kpɛmblatɛ Gehasi labuɛ aatɔkɔ suoto alɛ, “saate nii lasii ɔyɔɔ ɔta Naaman, Siria otii nwu alɛ atafũ ni asaa ya aawako nii. Nwaako, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, kamatoso ntikanko nwɔ ninaafũ lɛsaa lewo di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Nioso Gehasi lapɛsɛwa aati Naaman. Obe wɔ di Naaman lanyɔɔ nii, aasoo di keke nɔɔ suoto aalaakyakako nwɔ. Ni di Naaman lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Mme ɔlaa kuonwii nnaa?”<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Ni di Gehasi ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ɔlaa kuonwii nnaa, saate nii niekpee mi alɛ, ‘Bakosopo banyɔ di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi kamɛ ntookye Efraim lekpenkpe kale bɛɛwa ɔkyɛ nii kanunua. Nioso lekoto tɛɛ koto fututu bakilo onutũ afosi-atiɛ- bana ku abula lɛkpa sɛnyɔ.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Ni di Naaman labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako, fũ bakilo afosi-akuɛnsĩ-banɛ.” Aanyinka Gehasi alɛ afũ nya, ni aanii koto fututu bakilo afosi-akuɔ-banɛ nwu di bakotoku banyɔ kamɛ ku abula sɛkpa sɛnyɔ nwu nɛ. Ni di Naaman layɔ nya aata bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ banyɔ, baatuka nya baale Gehasi katũ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Di Gehasi lawa ni lekpenkpe nwu, ni aafũ asaa nwu di bakpɛmblatɛ nwu nnɛɛ, ni aablasa nya di leyo nwu suoto aalaatɛ nɛ. Ni aata batii nwu lasifi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Ninfɛ di Gehasi lakyɛ aalaayila di saate nɔɔ Elisa anu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Ni di Elisa lakaalɛ alɛ, “Gehasi, ɔfɛ feekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Ni di Gehasi ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ diɛkyɛ kaakɔkaakɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Kafɔɔ Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Sɛɛ ninwuna nii ditasiɛko fɔ di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu lasoo ni di keke nɔɔ suoto aabakyakako fɔ ni? Obe wɔ mmle kamɛ dikaatɛ fanfũ koto ee fanfũ abula, nnɔnyi awoso, nnɔnyi awoso afe, bafoso, banankyue ee bakpɛmblatɛ-suɔtɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ-sanko? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Nioso Naaman ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nwu kamaka di suoto lɛfɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ suoto dinaa ni kaloo.” Ninfɛ di Gehasi lakyɛ di Elisa anu aasifi, ni di ɔfiɛ sɛɛle labla nwɔ suoto fututu fɛ atubakani nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa Ladiki Kafɛ̀ Ka Niakpa Kaabuo Ni Di Okle Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ dikudi nwu latɔkɔ Elisa alɛ, “Nyu, lɛba le munsi ni ku afɔ lɛsii wo obiibii. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Ta bukyɛ Yordan di obiala loo alaamiɛ lɛkpaka; faata wo buɔbla lɛba di nfa nkpo busiɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Bikyɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Ninfɛ di onwii lɛma labuɛ alɛ, “Lekoto flootikanko bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kamakyɛ.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Ni aatikanko ma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:4">Nioso baakyɛ Yordan baalaakyako awoso obudi ɔtɛ. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Di onwii lɛma latoobudi ni kowoso kunwii yi, ni di lɛbɔɔsaa kafɛ disi nwu lakpa diabuo di okle kamɛ nɛ. Ni aafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Ao, saate nii, ɔnyanyi lanyanyi ka lo!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Ni di Yaa otii nwu lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔfɛ kɛɛkpa keebuo?” Obe wɔ aatuo nwɔ ni lɛba nwu, ni di Elisa labudi kawesee aafuki aakpee ninfa, ni di kafɛ lɛbɔɔsaa nwu latika diasaka di ntu nwu osi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tekete ka.” Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lananfi kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aayɔ ka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Lalenkee Siria Batii Bakpɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Ninfɛ di Siria ɔka latɔɔkpɛko Israel nɛ. Ni baakpee ni asi baawo ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ baaloo nii, ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Kamabla kasikɔ nii di lɛba le ku lɛba le.”<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Ni di Yaa otii nwu lata Israel ɔka kanya alɛ, “Lolaa fanyu ku lɛba nwu ofe, diekye Siria batii kosoo manfe nfa.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Nioso Israel ɔka lawolaa lɛba le di Yaa otii nwu labuɛ nii. Di obe, di obe kamɛ Elisa ntɔkɔ Israel ɔka, di mmle aalolaa suoto nɔɔ annyu ni di aba nwu suoto.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Nle mmle latɛ diafiɛ Siria ɔka ɔblɔ. Ni aalɛɛ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ aasiisa, aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ mi, owe loo nin-yɛ Israel ɔka kamaa?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Ni di ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔ onwii labuɛ alɛ, “saate nii, kuonwii loo, kafɔɔ Elisa, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu ninkpe ni di Israel ntɔkɔ Israel ɔka sɛlaa se tutuutu fambuɛ ni di letenyo lɛfɔ kamɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Ni di Siria ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bikyɛ biɛlaawolaa nfũ asi ni, ninkpee batii baalaamufũ nwɔ.” Ni baakple baabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: “Akpe di Dotan.” <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Ninfɛ aakpee bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni ku bakpɛtɛ siene nfa nɛ. Baakyɛ ku kakyɛ baalaamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Obe wɔ di Yaa otii nwu kpɛmblatɛ onwii lataka ni kaleesɛ ku kuyitatũ, ni aanya bakpɛtɛ ku bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni lamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi. Ni di kpɛmblatɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ao, saate nii, be bubabla?”<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Mba ninkpe ni ku awo mpɔ balenke mba ninkpe ni ku mma.”<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Ni di Elisa lapɛ ɔlaa alɛ, “Oo SAATE, tikiti nwɔ anu alɛ aanya.” Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latikiti kpɛmblatɛ nwu anu, ni aanyu nii, aanya alɛ akpenkpe nwu layii ku bapɔnkɔ ku ɔtɔ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni bamuu lamana Elisa baakyi nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Di balo lasoo baatɔɔwa nwɔ ni katũ, Elisa lapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu alɛ, “Ta batii ba mmle anu abiɛ.” Nioso SAATE nwu lata anu labiɛ ma, fɛ mmle di Elisa lakaalɛ nii.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Diele nfũ ninle osuku, diele nfũ kafɔɔ ninle okpoo kplɛ nwu. Bitikankoe, kamakpaa ye nkyɛnko otii wɔ biowolaa ni nfũ.” Ni aakpaa ma aasifiko Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Baabuo ni okpoo nwu baaloo nii, Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE, tikiti bakpɛtɛ ba mmle anu alɛ baanya.” Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latikiti ma anu, ni baanya alɛ nfɛ bakpe di Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Di Israel ɔka lanya ma nii, ni aakaalɛ Elisa alɛ, “Nlo ma? Teete nii, nlo ma?”<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Tanlo ma. Fabalo batii ba feemufũ ni ku kapamii ee kɔtaa lɛfɔ kumu? Se ma alesaa ku ntu, baale, baanyi baakple basifi saate lɛma nfũ.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Nioso Israel ɔka latũ opunu kplɛ aata ma. Baale, baanyi baaloo nii, aadiki ma osuku, ni baakple baasifi saate lɛma nfũ nɛ. Nioso Siria bakpɛtɛ ladiɛ Israel kasɔ nwu odieko.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakpɛtɛ Lamana Samaria Baakyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Di obe owo kamaa, Siria ɔka Ben-Hadad lasiisa bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu, ni baakata baakyɛ baalaamana Samaria baakyi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Kɔka kplɛ kunwii latɔɔkpɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu; ɔmana okyi nwu latɛ diaklɛ oso diata alɛ baatoosunsũ bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo disi ninwii, koto fututu afosi-anɛ, ablonuma mbi kɔlafa onutũ kafɔɔ lafũ koto fututu anɔɔ.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Di Israel ɔka latoofe ni di oyoyiɛ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ, ɔsanko onwii lafaa aalɛɛ nwɔ aatɔkɔ alɛ, “saate nii ɔka, kyakaakoe!”<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Ni di ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nse SAATE nwu diɛkyakaako fɔ, ni ɔfɛ kamawɛ lɛkyakaako nta fɔ?” Di asaa kapɛkɔ? Di nta kawankɔ? <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Ninfɛ aakaalɛ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Be ɔlaa kule?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Ni di ɔsanko nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Ɔsanko wɔ mmle latɔkɔ mi alɛ, ‘Yɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ fawako buowee miɛ, kɔsɛɛ kafɔɔ bubawee obisuɔtɔbi nii.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Nioso buawa obisuɔtɔbi nii buawee. Kaleesɛ latɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, ‘Yɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ fawako buowee nwɔ,’ kafɔɔ ɛɛyɔ nwɔ eekookaa.”<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Obe wɔ di ɔka nwu lanu ni ɔsanko nwu sɛlaa yi, ni aabɛbɛɛ akpeele wua nɔɔ nɛ. Aakyɛ ni di oyoyiɛ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ, batii nwu lanya alɛ aanyukũ leboko, aatɛ akpeele nɔɔ kasɔ. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Ni di ɔka nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Yaa anaanfi mi kootoko, bia ata diwɛ osie nwaa, nse Safat obisuɔtɔbi, Elisa disi lekple diɛsɔ di amuusi nɔɔ miɛ!”<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Obe nwu Elisa lasiɛ di leyo nɔɔ, banɔɔfo nɔɔ kafɔɔ lasiɛ ku nnwɔɔ. Ninfɛ di ɔka lakpee otii aale nwɔ katũ nɛ. Kafɔɔ di tɔkyɛntɛ nwu lababuo nii, Elisa ntɔɔtɔkɔ banɔɔfo nɔɔ alɛ, “Bilɔɔnya mmle di batii-lotɛ nwu kokpee ni otii alɛ ababudi mi ni disi? Binyu, nse tɔkyɛntɛ nwu lɛwa yi, bisɛɛ kokloo, biɛsɛɛ ni bikpee nwɔ. Diele saate nɔɔ nnafukpaa ninkpi nwɔ kamaa nɛ?”<verse eid="2KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Obe wɔ aakple aatɔɔkakatɛ nii, ni di tɔkyɛntɛ lasoo aawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nɛ. Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Dibuo le mmle lekye SAATE nwu nfũ. Be oso kakple nsoko SAATE nwu?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Ninfɛ di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kɔsɛɛ nuakpa okle, babasunsũ nnaafũ bakilo banɔɔ ku akpaa bakilo lefosi, koto fututu kunwii di Samaria kayokontũ.”<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Ni di ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ kɔnɛɛ suoto di ɔka lakpɛ ni latɔkɔ Yaa otii nwu alɛ, “Nyu, nse bia SAATE nwu lɛsɛkɛtɛ osi n-yoko, nle mmle kafuo ɔwa kaanya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Fabanya ni ku anu lɛfɔ amu, kafɔɔ flɔbale kuniwii nini!”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siria Batii Bakpɛtɛ Lasifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Ninfɛ di basuɔtɔ bana lawɛ ofiɛ sɛɛle di okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko nɛ. Ni baatɔkɔ bawo alɛ, “Be oso buasiɛ ninfũ ninaase di obe wɔ bubakpi ni? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Nse buobuɛ bulɛ, ‘Buosifi okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ’- kɔka nkpe ninfa, ni bubakpi. Nse buosiɛ ninfũ kafɔɔ, bubakpi. Nioso bita busifi Siria batii kasikɔ buɔlaayɔ suoto buta. Nse beediɛ wo, bubasiɛ nkpa; nse beelo wo kafɔɔ, bubakpi.”<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Ni baataka ku kolesɛtũ baasifi Siria batii kasikɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ baadu ni kasikɔ nwu kanya, otii kuonwii ditawɛ ninfa. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Diekye SAATE nwu lata Siria batii nwu lanu bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ ku bakpɛtɛ kplɛ sɛlɔ. Nioso baabuɛ baatɔkɔ bawo alɛ, “Binyu, Israel ɔka lɛyɔ Heti batii ku Egipte batii baka alɛ babakpɛ wo!” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Nioso baataka baatoso ku kolesɛtũ nwu, baadiɛ akpaayo lɛma ku bapɔnkɔ lɛma ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba nintuka ni atoo. Baadiɛ kasikɔ nwu fɛ mmle kaate nii, baata nkpa lɛma, baatoso.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Ni di basuɔtɔ ba niawɛ ni ɔfiɛ sɛɛle nwu ladu ni kasikɔ nwu kanya, ni baabuo lɛkpaayo ninwii kamɛ nɛ. Baale, baanyi ni baatuka koto fututu, koto sɛɛle ku akleesaa lɛma baasifiko baalaakookaa nɛ. Baakple baababuo lɛkpaayo bamba kamɛ baalaayɔ asaa awo baalaakokaa, nnya kafɔɔ.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Ni baatɔkɔ bawo alɛ, “Buloololaa bubla. Miɛ ninle ɔlaa biene dii, ni buole ni munta suoto loo nɛ. Nse buosoko diɛlaadu obe wɔ di kale lɛkpa nii, ni letoko naanfi kamawa wo di suoto. Ta bukyɛ buɔlaabuɛ ɔlaa wɔ mmle di ɔka leyo.”<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Nioso baakyɛ baalaalɛɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko banyuntɛ baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Buakyɛ Siria batii kasikɔ, kafɔɔ otii kuonwii ditawɛ- butanu kuonwii lɛkpanko- bapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni aatoo, beekpee ni sikũ beese ni, ku akpaayo lɛma lete baadiɛ fɛ mmle aate nii.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ni di kayoko banyuntɛ lafaa baabuɛ ɔlaa nwu, ni kuakyaka lɛkayo nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lataka ku kakyɛ, ni aatɔkɔ banɔɔfɔtii nɔɔ alɛ, “Kamatɔkɔ ye lɛsaa le di Siria batii nwu lɛbla wo nii. Baye alɛ kɔka kolo wo; nioso beedie di kasikɔ nwu bɛɛlaawofa di lepoo kamɛ, beenyu alɛ, ‘Nwaako, babadie manwa, munmufũ ma ku nkpa, mumbuo di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Ni di ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔ onwii labuɛ alɛ, “Bita bakpɛtɛ nwu bawo bayɔ bapɔnkɔ ba niebu ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu banɔɔ. Mma kafɔɔ babate fɛle Israel batii ba bamuu niebu ni ninfũ- nwaako, ote babate fɛle Israel batii ba mmle niekpi nii. Nioso ta bukpee ma baalaanyu lɛsaa le niɛwa ni.”<verse eid="2KI 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Nkpo oso baadiki bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni banyɔ ku bapɔnkɔ lɛma, ni di ɔka lakpee ma Siria batii bakpɛtɛ nfũ nɛ. Aatɔkɔ bakatɛ nwu alɛ, “Bikyɛ biɛlaanyu lɛsaa le nikɔwa ni.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Baatikanko ma baalaadu bia Yordan okle, ni baanya di osuku nwu omuu, mmle baatɛtɛɛ ni akleesaa ku akpɛnsaa ya di Siria batii lafuki baayu ni di kakpɛ otoso lɛma kamɛ nɛ. Nioso batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lakple baabatɔkɔ ɔka. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Ninfɛ di batii nwu lakyɛ baalaayɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa di Siria batii kasikɔ nwu nɛ. Nioso baasunsũ nnaafũ bikilo batiɛ ku akpaa bakilo bakuɔ, koto fututu kunwii fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Ninfɛ di ɔka layɔ ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ kɔnɛɛ suoto aakpɛ ni aase di kayoko nwu kanya nɛ. Ni di batii nwu lananafu nwɔ di kayoko nwu kanya, ni aakpi nɛ. Fɛ mmle kanya di Yaa otii nwu labuɛ aatɛ ni, di obe wɔ di ɔka nwu lasoo aawa ni leyo nɔɔ. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Diawa fɛ mmle di Yaa otii nwu labuɛ aatɔkɔ ni ɔka alɛ, “Kɔsɛɛ nuakpa okle, babasunsũ nnaafũ bakilo batiɛ ku akpaa bakilo bakuɔ, koto fututu kunwii di Samaria kayokontũ.”<verse eid="2KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Di ɔnɔɔfotii nwu latɔkɔ ni Yaa otii nwu alɛ, “Nyu, nse bia SAATE nwu lɛsɛkɛtɛ osi n-yoko, nle mmle kafuo ɔwa kaanya?” Ni di Yaa otii nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Fabanya ni ku anu lɛfɔ amu, kafɔɔ flɔbale kuniwii nini!” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Nni kafɔɔ niale lɛsaa le niatɛ diawa nwɔ ni di suoto nɛ. Diekye batii lananafu nwɔ di kayoko nwu kanya, ni aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔsanko Wɔ Niakye Ni Sunem Lakple Aawa Leyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ ɔsanko wɔ obisuɔtɔbi aasɛnkɛsa ni alɛ, “Die ninfũ minko leyo lɛfɔ batii bilaasiɛ kɛɛkɛ di lɛba lele biafuo, diekye SAATE nwu ntɔɔta kɔka makpɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Nioso ɔsanko nwu latuna alɛ ɔɔbla fɛ mmle di Yaa otii nwu labuɛ nii. Ni di ɔsanko nwu ku leyo nɔɔ batii lasifi baalaasiɛ di Filisti batii kasɔ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Di alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ kayɛntɛkɔ ɔsanko nwu ladie di Filisti batii kasɔ, ni aakyɛ ɔka nfũ alɛ ɔɔlaatikiti nwɔ lekoto di leyo ku kasɔ nɔɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Ɔka nwu latɔɔkakatɛ ko Yaa otii nwu kpɛmblatɛ Gehasi ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Tɔkɔ mi asaa kplɛ ya amuu di Elisa ntɔɔbla ni.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Di Gehasi latɔɔtɔkɔ ɔtɔkɔ ɔka mmle di Elisa lasɛnkɛsa ni bakpi yi, ni di ɔsanko wɔ obisuɔtɔbi di Elisa lasɛnkɛsa ni lawa alɛ ɔɔbatikiti ɔka lekoto di leyo ku kasɔ nɔɔ suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Ni di Gehasi labuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔsanko nwu, saate nii, nnya obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ wɔ di Elisa lasɛnkɛsa ni.”<verse eid="2KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Nioso ɔka lakaalɛ ɔsanko nwu, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:6">Ni di ɔka ladiki ɔnɔɔfotii onwii alɛ anyu ɔsanko nwu ɔlaa, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kplesa lɛsaa biala ninle ni ɔsanko nwu lele fatɔɔ ku koto ko kumuu niakye ni kasɔ nɔɔ nwu suoto, diayɔ ni di dii le aadie ni di kale nwu diɛbadu ni kanunua.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Ku Siria Ɔka Ben-Hadad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elisa lakyɛ Damasko, ni di Siria ɔka Ben-Hadad latɔɔfiɛ nɛ. Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ ni ɔka alɛ, “Yaa otii nwu ntɔɔkata ɛɛwa ni ninfũ,” <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />ni di ɔka latɔkɔ Hasael alɛ, “Yɔ lɛkyɛsaa lewo faklee faalaakyakako Yaa otii nwu. Kaalɛ SAATE nwu fafenko di suoto nɔɔ; kaalɛ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Kamataka di ɔfiɛ wɔ mmle suoto?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Nioso Hasael lakyɛ aalaakyakako Elisa, aaklee kapubapɔnkɔ afosi ana atoo, niale ni Damasko asaa biene, biene amuu, fɛ akyɛsaa. Ni aakyɛ aalaayila di Elisa anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Ben-Hadad, ninle ni Siria ɔka niekpee mi alɛ makaalɛ fɔ nlɛ, ‘Kamataka di ɔfiɛ wɔ mmle suoto?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ falaatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nwaako fabataka’; kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lediki eetuo mi alɛ kubio abakpi.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latoonyu nwɔ tunwĩi dialaase di obe wɔ di sinunsɔ lakpɛ ni Hasael. Ninfɛ di Yaa otii nwu lakyako owi nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Ni di Hasael lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “saate nii, be oso foowi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “Diekye n-ye lɛsaa kpile le fababla ni Israel batii. Fabakpee ɔtɔ di aba lɛma ya beetofo seyoyiɛ beekyisa nii. Fanlo bakosopo lɛma ku kapamii, fan-yɔ babi lɛma fanlaasa ni kaasɔ, fambɛbɛɛ ni bamɛlakatɛ lɛma nfutu.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Ni di Hasael labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, weewee ko ale ni, kabla lɛsaa kplɛ le mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Ni di Elisa ladiki kanya alɛ, “SAATE nwu ntootuo mi alɛ fabale Siria ɔka.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Ninfɛ di Hasael ladiɛ Elisa aakple aasifi saate nɔɔ nfũ nɛ. Ni di Ben-Hadad lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe di Elisa lɛtɔkɔ fɔ?” Hasael ladiki kanya alɛ, “Aatɔkɔ mi alɛ nwaako fabataka.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Kafɔɔ kaleesɛ Hasael layɔ dibula le ninkpe ni opĩ aakpee di ntu kamɛ, ni aadiki ni aalaatĩi ɔka anu, diata alɛ ɔka lakpi. Ninfɛ di Hasael layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yoram</para>
  <para style="r">(2 Kor. 21.1-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Di Ahab obisuɔtɔbi Yoram, niale ni Israel ɔka lɛlɛɛ nɔnle kamɛ yi, di Yehosafat lale ni Yuda ɔka, ni di Yehosafat obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoram lakye kasɔ aatoole sɛka fɛ Yuda ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ alɛɛ anyɔ aafũ, di obe wɔ aabale ni ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ anɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Aakyɛ di Israel baka nwu sisuku suoto, fɛ mmle di Ahab leyo labla nii, diekye Ahab obisankobi aayɔ. Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Kafɔɔ, ta kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Dawid oso, SAATE nwu ditawɔɔsa Yuda. Diekye aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata Dawid ku banantii nɔɔ kandiɛ, dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Di Yehoram obe kamɛ, Edom lataka aayila di Yuda suoto, ni aase ɔka nɔɔ omu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Nioso Yoram lakyɛ Sair ku bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni bamuu. Ni di Edom batii lamana nwɔ ku bakeke nɔɔ nwu kanyabayilatɛ baakyi nɛ, kafɔɔ aataka ku kakyɛ aabɛ ma kamɛ aafe; bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ latoso baakple baasifi ayo lɛma. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Diɛbase ni di dii le baakpana ni kukũ ko mmle, Edom latɔɔtaka di Yuda suoto. Libnab kafɔɔ lataka aayila ma di suoto di obe nwu onwii kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Di sɛsaabla se bamba di Yoram sɛka ole kamɛ ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Ninfɛ di Yoram lalaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, baakookaa nwɔ ku mma di Dawid okpoo kplɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ahasia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Ahasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Di Israel ɔka Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Yoram lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, ni di Yehoram obisuɔtɔbi, Ahasia Yuda ɔka lakye kasɔ aatoole sɛka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ di Ahasia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka. Ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Atalia, aale ni Israel ɔka Omri ɔwa obisankobi. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Aakyɛ di Ahab leyo sisuku kanya, ni aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di Ahab leyo labla nii. Diekye Ahab leyo kamɛ ɔlɔ aale.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ninfɛ di Ahasia latikanko Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Yoram baakyɛ baalaakpɛko Siria ɔka Hasael di Ramot Gilead nɛ. Siria batii latika Yoram nkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Nioso Ɔka Yoram lakple aasifi Yesreel alɛ ɔɔlaakaasa nkɔ be di Siria batii latika nwɔ ni di Ramot, di kakpɛ nɔɔ ku Siria ɔka Hasael kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:29">Ninfɛ di Yuda ɔka Yehoram obisuɔtɔbi, Ahasia lasoo aakyɛ Yesreel aalaanyu Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Yoram nɛ, diekye baatika nwɔ nkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Baapɛ Yehu Ɔfɔɔ Fɛ Israel Ɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Elisa lalɛɛ osuɔtɔ onwii di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ kamɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yɔ akpeele wua lɛfɔ fakpee, faatika ofiamɛ lɛfɔ, faayɔ kakɔkɔɛ ka mmle ku ɔfɔɔ faatɔɔkyɛ Ramot Gilead. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Nse feebuo nfa, faawolaa Nimsi obisuɔtɔbi, Yehosafat obisuɔtɔbi Yehu. Faakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ falaakpaa nwɔ fadieko di bawo nɔɔ kamɛ fasifiko leyo le kaamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Faadiki kakɔkɔɛ nwu fanyɛɛnɛ ɔfɔɔ nwu fakpete nwɔ diisi faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛpɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ fɛ Israel ɔka.’ Faasɛkɛtɛ kayoko, faatoso fadie; tankyɛkyɛlɛ!”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Nioso okosopo, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lakyɛ Ramot Gilead. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Obe wɔ aabuo nii, aanya bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lasi baasiɛ. Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ, “Kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ, bɛɛtɛɛ kanya alɛ nta fɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Ni di Yehu lakaalɛ alɛ, “Kɛɛta owe loo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Afɔ, kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Ni di Yehu lataka aabuo leyo kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lanyɛɛnɛ ɔfɔɔ nwu aakpete di Yehu disi aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE , Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Lɛpɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di SAATE nwu batii, Israel suoto. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Dikpe ni fɛɛwɔɔsa saate lɛfɔ Ahab leyo. Kamabla nkyisa kafɔɔ di bakpɛmblatɛ Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nii ku SAATE nwu bakpɛmblatɛ bamuu ba ntɔ di Yesebel lawii ni suoto. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Ahab leyo nimuu kamakpi. Kamawɔɔsa Ahab osuɔtɔ biala di Israel- ɔlanle ee nnwɔ ninsiko ni suoto. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Kamabla Ahab leyo fɛle Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam leyo ku Ahiya obisuɔtɔbi, Basa leyo. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Yesebel nnwɔɔ yi, baweewee nimawee nwɔ di Yesreel kasɔ suoto, kuonwii dilɔbakookaa nwɔ.’ ” Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lasɛkɛtɛ kayoko aatoso aadie nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Obe wɔ di Yehu ladie aasifi ni banɔɔfotii wo nɔɔ nfũ yi, onwii lɛma lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Lɛsaa biala nlɛ? Be oso di fiibuotɛ nwu lɛwa fɔ ɔkyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">Ninfɛ di Yehu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Faye osuɔtɔ nwu ku sɛlaa se okle ambuɛ nii.”<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Kuote nkpo, tɔkɔ wo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Ninfɛ di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ aatɔkɔ mi ni, alɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛpɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka di Israel suoto.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Ni baapɛsɛwa baadidiki akpeele lɛma, baafukuti nya baatɛtɛɛ di nkpaa nɔɔ kasekɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ baafɛ kakyukye, baataasiwidi, baabuɛ alɛ, “Yehu nfɛ ninle ɔka!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu Lalo Israel Ɔka Yoram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Nioso Nimsi obisuɔtɔbi, Yehosafat obisuɔtɔbi, Yehu latɛ Yoram kala. (Di obe nwu Yoram ku Israel omuu latootĩtĩi Ramot Gilead di Siria ɔka Hasael suoto. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Kafɔɔ Ɔka Yoram ntookple eesifi Yesreel alɛ ɔɔlaakaasa nkɔ be di Siria batii latika nwɔ ni di kakpɛ lɛma ku Siria ɔka Hasael.) Ninfɛ di Yehu latɔkɔ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nwu alɛ, “Nse nkpo kanya bionyu, ni bitanta kuonwii lamaa aadie di okpoo kplɛ nwu aakyɛ aalaabuɛ ɔlaa nwu di Yesreel.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ninfɛ di Yehu labuo di keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni kamɛ aasiɛ aasifi Yesreel nɛ. Diekye Yoram latɔɔtɛ ɔnyɛɛ ninfa, ni di Yuda ɔka Ahasia lasoo aakyɛ alɛ ɔlaasɛɛsɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Obe wɔ di nnwɔ nin-yila ni di Yesreel leyo takale, le manyila manyu ni, lanya Yehu bakpɛtɛ kawɔ nii, ni aafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛnya bakpɛtɛ bawo kɔwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Ni di Yoram labuɛ alɛ, “Miɛ pɔnkɔ-siɛtɛ onwii fakpee aalaakyakako ma, aakaalɛ ma alɛ, ‘Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ biɛwa?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Ni di pɔnkɔ-siɛtɛ nwu lasiɛ pɔnkɔ aalaakyakako Yehu, aalaakaalɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kɔkaalɛ ni alɛ, ‘Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ biɛwa?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Ni di Yehu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Be kamɛ dikpe fɔ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole? Bafe sɛmaa nii wla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Ni di nyuntɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Tɔkyɛntɛ nwu ntoodu ma, kafɔɔ olosinkple awa.”<verse eid="2KI 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Nkpo oso ɔka lakple aakpee pɔnkɔ-siɛtɛ nyɔɔfa. Obe wɔ aakyɛ ni ɔkyɛ lɛma, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kɔkaalɛ ni alɛ, ‘Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ biɛwa?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Ni di Yehu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Be kamɛ dikpe fɔ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole? Bafe sɛmaa nii wla.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Ni di nyuntɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Tɔkyɛntɛ ntoodu ma, kafɔɔ olosinkple awa. Ɔkanle nwu nte fɛle Nimsi obisuɔtɔbi, Yehu- anka ni keke fɛle fiibuotɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Ni di Yoram labuɛ alɛ, “Bilolaa keke nii wɔ di pɔnkɔ nnanfi ni betɛɛ.” Baaloo nwɔ ni ololaa, ni di Israel ɔka Yoram ku Yuda ɔka Ahasia lasiɛ nwɔ baadie, obiala ku ole nwɔ omu baalaakyakako Yehu nɛ. Baalaakyakako nwɔ di kasɔ ka niale ni Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu kale. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Di Yoram lanya ni Yehu, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Yehu, atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ fɛɛwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Ni di Yehu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kawɛ, di yaafɔ afiɔ ɔtɔ ku sɛsɛɛ simuu mpɔ ni?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Ninfɛ di Yoram lamunikĩi aatoso, aatɔɔlɛɛ Ahasia alɛ, “Ahasia, kakpɛ kale!”<verse eid="2KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Ninfɛ di Yehu labɔkɔtɛ kɔtaa nɔɔ aataa Yoram di amuusi obo nɛ. Kɔtaa nwu latofo di otu nɔɔ ni aabɔkɔtɛ aanɔɔ di keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnaanfi ni kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Ni di Yehu latɔkɔ Bidkar wɔ niale ni keke nɔɔ ɔnɔɔfotii alɛ, “Kɛnkɛ nwɔ fafuki fayu di kofe ko ninle ni Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu kole kamɛ. Nyuma mmle buasi buatɔɔka ni bakeke buatikanko ni Yoram ote, Ahab sɛɛmaa di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni ɔlaa di suoto nɔɔ aatɛ ni alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />‘Kɔsa lanya Nabot ntɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ntɔ, SAATE nwu niabuɛ, ni nwaako kamanyu nlɛ fɛɛta ntɔ nwu koto di kasɔ ka mmle suoto, SAATE nwu niabuɛ.’ Nioso kanunua kɛnkɛ nwɔ fafuki fayu di kasɔ nwu suoto, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Obe wɔ di Yuda ɔka Ahasia lanya ni lɛsaa le niawa nii, ni aatoso aayɔ osuku aakata aasifi Bet Hagan. Ni di Yehu latikanko nwɔ aatooyiisa kudu alɛ, “Lo nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ!” Baatika nwɔ nkɔ di keke nɔɔ kamɛ, aakyɛ ni di osuku oofe ni Gur ninkaako ni Yibleam okpoo. Kafɔɔ aatoso aasifi Megido aalaakpi ninfa. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ layɔ kpi nɔɔ baakpee di keke kamɛ baasifiko Yerusalem, baalaakookaa nwɔ ku bate nɔɔ di ɔkya nɔɔ kamɛ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />(Di Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Yoram lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ di Ahasia labale Yuda ɔka.)<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalo Ɔkasanko Yesebel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Ninfɛ di Yehu lakyɛ Yesreel nɛ. Di Yesebel lanu nwu ni ole, ni aalolaa anu nɔɔ, aabla disi nɔɔ, ni aatoonyu di sɛfle nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Di Yehu labuo ni di kayoko, Yesebel lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ wɔ ninte ni fɛle Simri wɔ nialo ni saate nɔɔ, fɛɛwa ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole?”<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Ni di Yehu lanyu osi di sɛfle nwu aakaalɛ alɛ, “Owe nin-yɛ mi kamaa? Owe?” Ni di batii ba aatáa beediki ni banyɔ ee batiɛ lanyu nwɔ kasɔkasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Ni di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Bifuki ɔsanko nwu beyu kaayi!” Nioso baafuki nwɔ baayu kaayi, ni di ntɔ nɔɔ nwo lakpete di oyoyiɛ ku bapɔnkɔ suoto di obe wɔ baananafu ni ɔsanko nwu ku nkpaa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Ninfɛ di Yehu lasifi aalaale, aanyi nɛ. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Binyu ɔsanko nwu baakpaani ni, bikookaa nwɔ, diekye ɔka obisankobi aale.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ baadie baakyɛ alɛ bɔɔlaakookaa ni ɔsanko nwu, batanya lɛsaalɛsaa, diediki disi nɔɔ dikufi, nkpaa ku nnɛɛ nɔɔ lete. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Ni baalaatɔkɔ Yehu nɛ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Nle mmle ninle ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu lakakatɛ aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Elia, Tisbi otii nwu suoto nɛ: Di Yesreel kasɔ suoto di baweewee kamawee Yesebel suoto sina. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Yesebel suoto kamate fɛle aku ya ninte ni kaasɔ di Yesreel kasɔ, di mmle di kuonwii dilɔbabuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Nnya Yesebel.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Baalo Ahab Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Ahab lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi afosi-akuɛnsĩ di Samaria. Nioso Yehu lakpana akũ aakyesee Samaria: aata banɔɔfotii, okpoo banɔɔfo ku Ahab babi disi banyuntɛ di Yesreel. Aabuɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Di saate lee babisuɔtɔbi nkpe ni di ɔkyɛ lee, di bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku okpoo kplɛ wɔ beetofo oyoyiɛ beekyisa ni ku akpɛsaa nkpe ye nioso yi, nse kukũ ko mmle ledu ye odu, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />biediki saate lee obisuɔtɔbi wɔ niɛtɛ alɛ ni, akpe ni kɔnɛɛ nwaa, biɛyɔ nwɔ bisiɛsa di ote lɛkakpomii suoto. Biɛkpɛ kakpɛ bita saate lee leyo nfɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Kafɔɔ baayɛkɛ, ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Nse baka banyɔ ditafuo oyila di anu nɔɔ, ni lɛ nfɛ di awo buafuo?”<verse eid="2KI 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Nioso lɛkayo asaa nyuntɛ, okpoo kplɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ, okpoo banɔɔfo ku babi asi banyuntɛ nwu lata Yehu kanya ka mmle alɛ, “Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bule, bubabla lɛsaa lele fɛɛtɔkɔ wo. Bulɔbadiki kuonwii fɛ ɔka; afɔ bla lele feenyu falɛ dilɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Ninfɛ di Yehu lakpana kukũ nyɔɔfa aata ma aabuɛ alɛ, “Nse biyɛ mi kamaa, bibanu mi ɔlaa yi, ni biebudi saate lee babisuɔtɔbi asi, biɛyɔ biwakoe di Yesreel kɔsɛɛ nua akpa okle.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Obe nwu ɔka babisuɔtɔbi afosi-akuɛnsĩ nwu lawɛ ku okpoo kplɛ nwu banɔɔfotii ba niatoonyu ma ni asi nfũ. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Di kukũ nwu lababuo nii, basuɔtɔ ba mmle lakpaa ɔka babisuɔtɔbi ba mmle afosi-akuɛnsĩ bamuu baalaalo ma. Ni baayɔ asi lɛma nwu baakpee di nkyikyɛ kamɛ baayɔ baakyɛnko Yehu di Yesreel nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Obe wɔ di tɔkyɛntɛ nwu lalaabuo nii, aatɔkɔ Yehu alɛ, “Batɔɔwako ɔka babisuɔtɔbi asi nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Ninfɛ di Yehu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bisiisa nya di akudi anyɔ, di okpoo kplɛ kayoko nwu kanya di kale kasɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Kaleesɛ ku oyita Yehu ladie. Ni aalaayila di batii nwu bamuu anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Biele lɛbɛ. Ami niataka di saate nii suoto, lalo nwɔ, kafɔɔ owe nielo mba mmle bamuu? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Ni bitofo bilɛ, ɔlaa kuonwii nnaa di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni di Ahab leyo suoto dilɔbasĩ ku ɔwa kaanya. SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla di nle aabuɛ aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Elia suoto.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Nioso Yehu lalo obiala niabu ni di Ahab leyo di Yesreel. Aalo banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu, basiɛwo nɔɔ tintĩ ku olebatatɛ nɔɔ, atabu kuonwii lɛma aasiɛ nkpa.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalo Ɔka Ahasia Banantii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Ninfɛ di Yehu ladie aasifi aakyɔɔ anu Samaria nɛ. Di Bet Eked, di lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Bafoso Bakpatɛ, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />ni aakyakako Yuda ɔka Ahasia banantii bawo nɛ, ni aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Bawe bile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">Ni baabuɛ alɛ, “Ahasia banantii bule, buosoo buɔwa bulɛ buɔbasɛɛsa ɔka leyo batii ku ɔkasanko Yesebel bale.”<verse eid="2KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Ni di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Bimufũ ma ku nkpa!” Nioso baamufũ ma ku nkpa baalo di Bet Eked ditubiɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ- batii afosi-ana-banyɔ baale. Atabu kuonwii asiɛ nkpa.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalo Ahab Banantii Ba Niabu Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Aadie ni ninfa sɛmaa, aabakyakako Rekab obisuɔtɔbi, Yehonadab wɔ niatoofe nwɔ ni ɔkyakako. Ni di Yehu lasɛɛsɔɔ aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Fɛɛbla onwii ku ami, fe mmle lɛbla ni ku afɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Ni di Yehonadab ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛbla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Ni di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Nse nkpo kute, ni kpee mi kɔnɛɛ.” Nkpo oso Yehu lakyakaako nwɔ aabuo di keke nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Ninfɛ di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Tikankoe fabanyu mmle lɛyɔ nwu ni ole lɛta ni SAATE nwu.” Ninfɛ aatɔɔ aasiɛ di keke nɔɔ kamɛ baafenfe nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Obe wɔ di Yehu lawa ni Samaria, aalo mba bamuu niabu nii, baale ni Ahab leyo batii. Aawɔɔsa ma, di ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Elia kanya.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalo Baal Basumutɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Ninfɛ di Yehu lasiisa batii nwu bamuu aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ahab lasumu Baal kɛɛkɛ; Yehu kamasumu nya ampɔɔsa. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Nunua bilɛɛ Baal ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu ku olebatatɛ nɔɔ bamuu. Binyu bilɛ kuonwii diedie kaamɛ, diekye kɔwa oleɔta kplɛ ɔbata ɔta Baal. Olele niesĩ ɔwa dilɔbasinsiɛ nkpa.” Kafɔɔ Yehu latɔɔbla nle mmle di kakyɔnkyɔ kanya di mmle aawɔɔsa ni Baal banɔɔfotii nwu.<verse eid="2KI 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Ni di Yehu labuɛ alɛ, “Bilɛɛ bawo bisiisa baata Baal dibu.” Nioso baayie nwu lɛkya. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Ninfɛ di Yehu lata kanya di Israel aafenko nɛ. Ni di Baal banɔɔfotii bamuu lawa nɛ, kuonwii ditabu. Baakya kpa di Baal kafiofa nwu dialaase di obe wɔ di leyo nwu layii ni di disi le dialaase ni di disi le. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Ni di Yehu latɔkɔ akpeele kleetɛ alɛ, “Yɔ Baal banɔɔfotii nwu akpeele amuu fawako.” Nioso aayɔ akpeele nwu aawako ma.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Ninfɛ di Yehu ku Rekab obisuɔtɔbi, Yehonadab lakyɛ Baal kafiofa nwu nɛ. Ni di Yehu latɔkɔ Baal banɔɔfotii nwu alɛ, “Binyu bifenko, bienyu bilɛ SAATE nwu bakpɛmblatɛ kuonwii nnaa ninfũ ku aye- Baal banɔɔfotii lete.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Nioso baabuo kamɛ alɛ bɔɔta oleɔta ku ɔfiɛ asaaɔta. Ninfɛ di Yehu lakyesee basuɔtɔ afosi-anɛ kaayi ku ɔlaa wɔ mmle alɛ, “Nse onwii lee lɛta onwii lɛma ba kɔyɔ nkpee ye ni ninnɛɛ letoso, ni dibale nkpa lɛfɔ di nkpa nɔɔ disi.”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Di Yehu laloo ni oloo ofiɛ asaaɔta ɔta, ni aadiki banyuntɛ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ kanya alɛ: “Bikyɛ biɛlaalo ma, bitanta kuonwii latoso.” Nioso baasasafɔ ma baatɛ ku kapamii. Banyuntɛ ku banɔɔfotii nwu lafuki bakpi nwu baayu kaayi, ni baabuo di kafiofa nwu kaamɛ di Baal difiɔyo nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Baadiki difuɔ klekle nwu di Baal difiɔyo baawako kayi babafiɛ ni. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Baakpa Baal difuɔ klekle nwu, baabibiɛ Baal difiɔyo baatɛ kaasɔ. Ni di batii nwu layɔ nfa baatika okpo diabase di dii le baakpana ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Nioso Yehu lawɔɔsa Baal kasumu di Israel. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Kafɔɔ, Yehu ditadiɛ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, nse aata ni Israel labla nii- koto sɛɛle lɛnankyuebi osumu nwu di Betel ku Dan.<verse eid="2KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Yehu alɛ, “Ta feelolaa fɛɛbla, feeloo ni nle ninlɛ ni di anu nii, fɛɛbla ni Ahab leyo batii nle nimuu labla ni disibu nlɛ kɔbla ni oso yi, banantii lɛfɔ kamasiɛ di Israel lɛkakpomii ninaadu kɔna naafa suoto.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Kafɔɔ Yehu ditatɛ suoto aale SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kufiofa ku otu nɔɔ omuu. Atakyi di Yeroboam sikpile kamaa, nse aata Israel labla nii.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Di ayi nwu nkpo kamɛ, SAATE nwu lakye kasɔ aatɔɔkɔkɔlɛ Israel kasɔ. Ni di Hasael lalenkee Israel batii diafe ni di kasɔ lɛma suoto <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ di Gilead kasɔ kamuu (Gad, Ruben ku Manase kasɔ), diayɔ ni di Aroer di Arnon kɔwɛ ɔlɔɔkɔ diafe ni di Gilead dialaadu ni Basan.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Yehu sɛka ole sɛsaabla bule, n-ya amuu aabla nii ku n-ya aafũ ni leyooto nnya, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Yehu latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Samaria nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yehoahas layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Obe wɔ di Yehu lale ni sɛka di Israel di Samaria labla alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɛ.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔkasanko Atalia</para>
  <para style="r">(2 Kro 22.10-23.15)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Di Ahasia ɔya, Atalia lanya alɛ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ntookpi nii, ni aawɔɔsa ɔka leyo kamɛ nimuu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Kafɔɔ Ɔka Yehoram obisankobi, Yehoseba, aale ni Ahasia obilɛma-sankobi layu Ahasia obisuɔtɔbi, Yoas aatosoko di ɔka babisuɔtɔbi ba alɛ babalo ni kamɛ. Ni di Yehoseba layɔ Yoas ku nyuntɛ nɔɔ aalaakpee di letenyo kamɛ alɛ oowofasa nwɔ di Atalia suoto; di mmle manamalo ni Yoas. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Nioso Yoas ku nyuntɛ nɔɔ lawɛ di kawofakɔ nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ alɛɛ akuɔ, di Atalia latoole ni sɛka di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Di lɛlɛɛ kuɛsinle kamɛ, Yehoiada lakpee baalɛɛ bakpɛtɛ kɔlafa akudi kanyabayilatɛ ku Kari batii ku ɔka asaa banyuntɛ baawako nwɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. Ni di Yehoiada labla kanya ninii ku mma, aayɔ ma aakpee di ntam kalɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ aatuo ma ɔka obisuɔtɔbi nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le bibabla ni: Aye ba ninle ni akudi atiɛ, biofe ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi- akudi atiɛ lee nwu ninwii kanyu ɔka leyo, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />dikudi tiɛfa ninwii di Sur Kayoko, di ditiɛfa ninwii kafɔɔ di kayoko ka di asaa banyuntɛ nwu sɛmaa-baatɔɔkyɛlɛnsa ni bawo di olekatakɔ nwu onyu suoto- <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />aye ba kafɔɔ di akudi anyɔ ya bule kamɛ ninankyɛ ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto, bamuu lee bienyu olekatakɔ nwu bita ɔka. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Biyila bikyi ɔka nwu, osuɔtɔ biala ku lɛkpɛsaa nɔɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. Dikpe ni bielo olele niɛwa ye katũ. Bitɛɛtɛɛ ɔka di kakɔ lele oofe.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Bakpɛtɛ kɔlafa nwu kanyabayilatɛ labla fɛ mmle kanya di oletatɛ Yehoiada labuɛ nii. Obiala lɛma lakpaa batii nɔɔ- mba ninkyɛ ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto ku mba ninankyɛ ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ- baakyɛ oletatɛ Yehoiada nfũ. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Ninfɛ aayɔ akplɔ ku kubiafunsaa ya niale ni Ɔka Dawid ale, aate ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ aata kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Asaa banyuntɛ nwu, obiala ku lɛkpɛsaa nɔɔ di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, layila baakyi ɔka- di oleɔta akyikye ɔlɔɔkɔ ku olekatakɔ nwu. Diayɔ ni di olekatakɔ nwu kala kasɔ dialaadu ni katoo kasɔ.<verse eid="2KI 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Ninfɛ di Yehoiada ladiki ɔka obisuɔtɔbi nwu aawako, aayɔ lɛkakoto nwu aatũkũsa nwɔ nɛ; aayɔ kanya ninii nwu kukũ aatɔɔ, ni aase nwɔ sɛka nɛ. Baapɛ Yoas ɔfɔɔ, ni di batii nwu lapɛ anɛɛkya baataasiwidi baabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔka asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Obe wɔ di Atalia lanu ni asaa banyuntɛ ku batii nwu kudu, ni aakyɛ batii nwu nfũ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Aanyu, ni aanya ɔka nwu n-yɛ di lɛkpaka ɔlɔɔkɔ, fɛ mmle di ɔsaabla nwu late nii. Banɔɔfotii ku kukyukyoe bafɛtɛ lawɛ di ɔka ɔlɔɔkɔ, kasɔ nwu batii bamuu kafɔɔ latɔɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ ku kukyukyoe ɔfɛ. Ninfɛ di Atalia labɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ aafaa aabuɛ alɛ, “Kale abiɛsaa nɛ! Kale abiɛsaa nɛ!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Ni di oletatɛ Yehoiada ladiki bakpɛtɛ kɔlafa kanyabayilatɛ ba niayila ni di bakpɛtɛ nwu kanya alɛ: “Bikpaa ɔsanko nwu bidieko di batii nwu kamɛ biwako, bielo olele nintikanko nwɔ ku kapamii.” Diekye oletatɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Diɛkaatɛ alɛ bielo ɔsanko nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Nioso baamufũ nwɔ, di obe wɔ aadu ni lɛba le di bapɔnkɔ nfe mambuo ni ɔka leyo, ni baalo nwɔ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiada Lawako Dikyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Ninfɛ di Yehoiada labla kanya ninii di SAATE nwu ku ɔka ku batii nwu ntɛɛ alɛ babale SAATE nwu batii nɛ. Aabla kafɔɔ kanya ninii di ɔka ku batii nwu ntɛɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Ni di kasɔ nwu batii bamuu lakyɛ Baal difiɔyo baalaabiɛ ni baatɛ kaasɔ nɛ. Baabibiɛ oleɔta akyikye ku afiɔ nwu wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ, baalo kafɔɔ Baal oletatɛ Matan di aleɔta akyikye nwu katũ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Ninfɛ di oletatɛ Yehoiada layɔ asaa banyuntɛ aase di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Ni aakpaa bakpɛtɛ alafa kanyabayilatɛ, Kari batii, asaa banyuntɛ ku kasɔ nwu batii bamuu aasiisa, ni baalaakpaa ɔka di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ baasifiko ɔka leyo nɛ. Baafe di asaa banyuntɛ osuku kayoko. Ninfɛ di ɔka lasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di lɛkakpomii suoto, <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />ni di kasɔ nwu batii bamuu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ. Ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu layɔɔ buɛɛ nɛ, ta Atalia wɔ baalo ni ku kapamii di lɛkayo oso.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ di Yoas lafũ fiɛ aakyako sɛka ole.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yoas Lalolaa Olekatakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Di Yehu sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ kuɛsinle kamɛ, Yoas labale ɔka, aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-ana. Ɔya leyooto niale Sibia; aakye ni Beerseba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yoas labla nle niabuo ni SAATE nwu anu di alɛɛ nwu amuu di oletatɛ Yehoiada latuo nwɔ ni asaa. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Kafɔɔ batabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu; ni di batii lakple baalaatɔɔta sele, baatɔɔfiɛ olufui ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Ni di Yoas latɔkɔ olebatatɛ nwu alɛ, “Bifũ koto ko kumuu bɛɛwako ni fɛ asaa ɔta klekle nwu biwako SAATE nwu olekatakɔ- koto ko beefũ ni di batii ɔka kamɛ, koto ko beefũ ni di otii onwii, onwii ntam ɔka kamɛ ku koto ko bɛɛta diekye ni di otu lɛma kamɛ biwako olekatakɔ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Ta oletatɛ biala afũ koto di koto batɛtɛ onwii ɔkyɛ, aata bayɔ kũ balolaa lɛba lele bɛɛnya alɛ diɛlalaa di olekatakɔ nwu suoto.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Kafɔɔ diabadu ni Ɔka Yoas alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-ditiɛfa kamɛ, olebatatɛ diilolaa olekatakɔ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Nioso Ɔka Yoas lalɛɛ oletatɛ Yehoiada ku olebatatɛ bamba aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Obe oso minoololaa olekatakɔ nwu niɛlalaa ni? Bitansinfũ koto kukunwii di kotobatɛtɛ lee nfũ, kafɔɔ biyɔ kũ bita baalolaa olekatakɔ nwu.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Nioso olebatatɛ nwu lafũ baakpee alɛ blɔbasinfũ koto kukunwii di batii nwu ɔkyɛ, kafɔɔ blɔbalolaa olekatakɔ nwu mma bamu.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Ninfɛ di oletatɛ Yehoiada layɔ lɛlakaa ninwii, ni aadufu dituɛ di katĩita nini nɛ. Ni aayɔ ni aase di oleɔta akyikye ɔlɔɔkɔ, di koletanɛɛkyɛ, nse otii kobuo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ. Olebatatɛ ba ninnyu ni kayoko n-yɔ koto ko kumuu bɛɛwako ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ mankpee di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Obe lele bɛɛnya alɛ koto kplɛ nfɛ nsi di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ yi, ɔka kukũ kpanatɛ ku oletatɛ-nɔɔfo nwa mamaka koto ko bɛɛwako ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, man-yɔ mankpee di atofo kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Nse batootofo koto ko kule nii, man-yɔ koto nwu manta otii wɔ beediki alɛ atoonyu ni olekatakɔ nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla. Baayɔ kũ baata mba niabla ni ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ- asaa bawolatɛ ku ayo batofotɛ, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />ayo bakpɛntɛ ku afuɔ babiɛtɛ. Baaya sewoso ku afuɔ ya baabibiɛ baata ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ololaa, baata kafɔɔ ato bamba amuu ya baakpee ni di olekatakɔ nwu ololaa kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Batayɔ koto ko baawako ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ baabla koto fututu babɛɛsi, kandiɛ sikũ, babɛɛsi, akyukyoo ee koto sɛɛle ee koto fututu asaa bamba awo baata SAATE nwu; <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />baayɔ kũ baata bakpɛntɛ ba niayɔ kũ baalolaa ni olekatakɔ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Batakaalɛ nkuntaa baakyeko mba baata ni koto nwu alɛ bata ni ɔkpɛ bablatɛ nwu, diekye baabla nwu ku nwaako ole nwaa kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Batayɔ koto ko niakye ni lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta ku okpile asaaɔta kamɛ baawako SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ; nkũ olebatatɛ kole kuale.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Siria ɔka Hasael lakata aakyɛ aalaadieko Gat okpoo kplɛ aalenkee nwu. Ni aamunikĩi alɛ oodieko Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Kafɔɔ Yuda ɔka Yoas layɔ akleklesaa ya di bate nɔɔ lakleklesa ni- Yosafat, Yoram ku Ahasia Yuda baka nwu- ku akyɛsaa ya di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ aakleklesa ni ku koto sɛɛle ko kumuu aanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ asaantɛkɔ ku lɛkayo, aayɔ nya aakyɛnko Siria ɔka Hasael, ni di nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aadiɛ Yerusalem ɔkpɛko nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Ablasaa bamba di Yoas sɛka ole kamɛ ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Yoas banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lakũ kawumbe di suoto nɔɔ ni baalo nwɔ di Bet Milo di osuku diosoo ninfe ni Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Banɔɔfotii ba nialo nwɔ ni niale Simeat obisuɔtɔbi, Yosakar ku Somer obisuɔtɔbi, Yosabad. Aakpi, ni baakookaa nwɔ ku bate nɔɔ di Dawid Okpoo Kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Amasia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Yehoahas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Di Ahasia obisuɔtɔbi Yoas, Yuda ɔka sɛka ole alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-ditiɛfa kamɛ yi, Yehu obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoahas labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka lefosi alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu ta aatikanko ni Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam sikpile se aata Israel batii labla ni, ata diɛ sĩ ni ɔbla oso. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Nioso ɔblɔ lafiɛ SAATE nwu di Israel suoto, ni aata ma baasiɛ di Siria ɔka Hasael ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ osie kalɔ baaklɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Ninfɛ di Yehoahas latikiti SAATE nwu lekoto, ni di SAATE nwu lanu aatɔɔ nɛ. Diekye SAATE nwu lanya mmle di Siria ɔka latɔɔbla ni Israel amumu. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Ni di SAATE nwu ladiki dikitɛ aata Israel, ni baadie di Siria osie nwu kalɔ nɛ. Nioso Israel batii nfɛ lasiɛ di ayo lɛma amu kamɛ fɛ mmle baasiɛ ni saa. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Kafɔɔ batadiɛ Yeroboam leyo kamɛ sikple se aata Israel labla ni ɔbla; baakple baatɔɔbla sĩ ɔbla. Nioso Asera owoso n-yɛ ɔyɛ di Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Lɛsalɛsaa ditabu Yehoahas bakpɛtɛ, diediki bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ afosi anɔɔ, bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni lefosi ku bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa nkpe lefosi. Diekye Siria ɔka lawɔɔsa babule, aabla ma kafɔɔ fɛle kudu di kakpaa.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Sɛsaabla bamba di Yehoahas sɛka ole kamɛ, n-ya aabla ni amuu ku n-ya aafũ ni leyooto yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehoahas lakpi, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Samaria nɛ. Ni di obisutɔbi nɔɔ Yoas layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Yoas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Di Yuda ɔka Yoas alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-dikuɛnsinle kamɛ yi, Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, Yoas labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka lefosi alɛɛ akuɛsĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, atadiɛ kafɔɔ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla ni kuonwii, nse aata Israel labla nii; aanwini aatɔɔbla sĩ.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Di ablasaa bamba di Yoas sɛka ole kamɛ, asaa ya amuu aabla ni ku n-ya aafũ ni leyooto, di kakpɛ nɔɔ ɔkpɛ ku Yuda ɔka Amasia nkyakaa nii, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yoas latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni di Yeroboam layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka di lɛkakpomii suoto nɛ. Ni baakookaa Yoas di Samaria ku Israel baka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔɔfiɛ ofiɛ wɔ kamɛ aakpi ni nɛ. Israel ɔka Yoas lasoo aakyɛ aalaanyu nwɔ, ni aawi Elisa nɛ. Aawi aabuɛ alɛ, “Teete nii! Teete nii! Israel bakeke ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Miɛ kɔtaa ku kɔtaa kubi kowo,” ni aabla nkpo nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Yɔ kɔtaa nwu faklee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ.” Obe wɔ aayɔ kũ aaklee ni di nnɛɛ nɔɔ, ni di Elisa layɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ aakpee di ɔka nwu nnɛɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Sɛkɛtɛ kufĩ katunkɔ sɛfle,” ni aasɛkɛtɛ nwɔ nɛ. Ni di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “Taa!” ni di ɔka nwu lataa nɛ. Ninfɛ di Elisa labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu lelenkee kɔtaa, lelenkee kɔtaa di Siria suoto! Fabawɔɔsa Siria batii fɛɛ di Afek okpoo kplɛ nwu.”<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Ninfɛ di Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yɔ kɔtaa nwu,” ni di ɔka nwu layɔ kũ nɛ. Ni di Elisa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Yɔ fatofo kaasɔ.” Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu layɔ kɔtaa nwu aatofo kaasɔ sitiɛ, ni aadiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Ninfɛ di Yaa otii nwu lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko nwɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Nse fan-yɔ fantofo kaasɔ sɛnɔɔ ee sikuɔ; ni nse fatabalenkee Siria fanwɔɔsa nwu fɛɛ. Kafɔɔ kanunua sitiɛ lete fabalenkee nwu.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Ni di Elisa lakpi baakookaa nwɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Moab batii ba ninfũ ni asaa di batii nnɛɛ ntoobuo kale nwu di kɔkyɛɛ biala kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Obe onwii kamɛ di Israel batii latookookaa ni osuɔtɔ onwii, nfanwu baanya batii ba ninfũ ni asaa di batii nnɛɛ dikudi; nioso baafuki kpi nwu baakpee di Elisa ɔkya kamɛ. Obe wɔ di kpi nwu lakaa ni di Elisa akufi yi, osuɔtɔ nwu lasɛnkɛ, ni aataka aayila ninkpaa nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Siria ɔka Hasael lanyinka Israel di Yehoahas sɛka ole nwu omuu kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lale ma sibualɛ, aanya ma nyaami, ni aayɔ nwu ole di suoto lɛma ta kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu ku Abraham, Isak ku Yakob oso nɛ. Diɛbase ni bia miɛ oloomiɛ alɛ awɔɔsa ma ee akyisa ma di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Siria ɔka Hasael lakpi, ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ben-Hadad layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ninfɛ di Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, Yoas lakple aafũ sekpoo se di Hasael obisuɔtɔbi, Ben-Hadad lafũ ni di ote Yehoahas nnɛɛ nɛ. Sitiɛ simu di Yoas lalenkee nwɔ, nioso aakple aafũ Israel batii sekpoo nwu.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Amasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Di Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoas Israel ɔka lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, ni di Yoas, Yuda ɔka obisuɔtɔbi, Amasia lakye sɛka ole kasɔ di Yuda nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka. Aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anaasĩ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yehoadin, aakye ni Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, kafɔɔ ditale fɛ mmle di ote Dawid labla nii. Di lɛsaa biala kamɛ, aatikanko ote Yoas ɔsaabla nkpaamaa. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Kafɔɔ batabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu; ni di batii nwu lakple baatɔɔta ole, baatɔɔfiɛ olufui ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Obe wɔ di sɛka kalekɔ nwu latɛ siasiɛ nwɔ ni ninnɛɛ yi, aaloloo banɔɔfotii ba nialo ni ote, ɔka. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Kafɔɔ atalo batii ba nialo ni ote babisuɔtɔbi, ta di mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Mose Kufiofa Kukũ kanya, di nfũ di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni alɛ: “Batanlo bate di babi lɛma kanya, ee balo babi di bate lɛma kanya. Obiala akpi di sikpile nɔɔ simu kanya.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amasia nwu niale nwɔ nialenkee ni Edom batii nkpe lefosi di Mmba Ɔtaata, aamufũ ni kafɔɔ Sela di kakpɛ kamɛ, aalɛɛ ni alɛ Yokteel, leyooto le niate ni dialaadu ni dii le baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Ninfɛ di Amasia lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoas wɔ niale ni Israel ɔka, Yehu obisuɔtɔbi nfũ ku kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Wa fabakyakakoe, anu ku anu.”<verse eid="2KI 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Kafɔɔ Israel ɔka Yehoas lakplesa kanya aata Yuda ɔka Amasia alɛ: “Owuu dibuu ninwii di Lebanon lɛta seda kanya di Lebanon alɛ, ‘Yɔ obisankobi lɛfɔ fata obisuɔtɔbi nii ayɔ.’ Ninfɛ di lepoo kamɛ bɔkɛɛ kplɛ onwii di Lebanon lawa aabananafu owuu dibuu nwu di nkpaa kalɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Nwaako faalenkee Edom, ni di nunua fɔɔtakatɛsa suoto katoo nɛ. Wɛ Dibu di lelenkee lɛfɔ nwu, kafɔɔ siɛ di leyo lɛfɔ! Be oso foomiɛ ɔlaa ku kasɔ ɔpɛ fanta afɔ omu lɛfɔ suoto ku Yuda lele kafɔɔ?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Kafɔɔ Amasia ditanu, nioso Israel ɔka Yehoas lalakpɛ. Nnwɔɔ ku Yuda ɔka Amasia lakpɛ bawo anu ku anu di Bet Semes di Yuda kasɔ. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Ninfɛ di Israel lalenkee Yuda, ni di kpɛtɛ biala latoso aasifi leyo nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Ni di Israel ɔka lamufũ Yuda ɔka Amasia wɔ niale ni Yoas obisuɔtɔbi wɔ niale ni Ahasia obisuɔtɔbi di Bet Semes nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yehoas lakyɛ Yerusalem aalaabibiɛ Yerusalem seyoyiɛ aatɛ kaasɔ, diayɔ ni di Efraim Kayoko dialaadu ni Leyokɔ Kayoko- kakyɛ nwu labla fɛ nkpaa alafa akuɔ lɛkaana. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Aayɔ koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu ku asaa ya amuu aanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo asaakatɛkɔ. Aakpaa kafɔɔ mba aamufũ ni di kakpɛ kamɛ, ni aakple aasifi Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Di Yehoas sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba suoto, n-ya aabla ni ku n-ya aafũ ni leyooto, di kakpɛ ku Yuda ɔka Amasia nsi ni kaamɛ, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Ni di Yehoas latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, baakookaa nwɔ di Samaria ku Israel baka nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yeroboam layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Amasia Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Yoas obisuɔtɔbi, Amasia wɔ niale ni Yuda ɔka lasiɛ nkpa alɛɛ lefosi-anɔɔ di Yehoahas obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoas wɔ niale ni Israel ɔka kukpi sɛmaa. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Di Amasia sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba suoto yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Batii lakũ kanwumbe di Amasia suoto di Yerusalem, ni aatoso aasifi Lakis nɛ, kafɔɔ baakpee batii baati nwɔ baakyɛ Lakis baalaalo nwɔ ninfa. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Baayɔ kpi nɔɔ nwu baatika di pɔnkɔ suoto baawako baabakookaa di Yerusalem ku bate nɔɔ di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Ninfɛ di Yuda batii bamuu layɔ Asaria,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwɔɔ mankple manlɛɛ Usia nɛ</char></note> di obe wɔ atoofũ ni alɛɛ lefosi-akuɔ baase sɛka di ote Amasia kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Nnwɔɔ niale otii wɔ niase ni Elat okpoo dibudi, aakplesa nwu aata Yuda, di Amasia latɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ sɛmaa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Yeroboam Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Di Yoas obisuɔtɔbi, Yuda ɔka Amasia lɛlɛɛ lefosi-nɔɔnle kamɛ yi, ni di Yehoas obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ afosi-ana-ninwii nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, atadiɛ Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam sikpile kuonwii aatɛ, nse aata Israel labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Nnwɔɔ niale otii wɔ niase ni Israel kasɔ amɛ ofũ nɛ, diayɔ ni di Lebo Hamat dialaadu ni Araba Lekpo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lekpo nwu kafɔɔ ninle Mmba Lekpo nɛ</char></note> di ɔlaa wɔ kanya di SAATE, Israel Yaa lakakatɛ aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Amitai obisuɔtɔbi, Yona suoto, aale ni Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niakye ni Gat Hefer nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />SAATE nwu lanya mmle diatoobuo ni otii biala di Israel osie kanya, ɔlanle woo ee nwɔ nisiko ni suoto; kuonwii ditawɛ aakyakaako ma nii. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Ta di SAATE nwu ditabuɛ alɛ abayɛɛsa ni Isarel leyooto di kolo kalɔ oso yi, ni aadiki ma aafenko di Yehoas obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam kɔnɛɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Di Yeroboam sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, n-ya amuu aabla ni ku nkpɛ nɔɔ be aalenkee nii, di mmle aakple aafũ ni Damasko ku Hamat, aakyuu nwu anyɔ niale ni Yaudi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leyooto nwu ninle ole Yuda nɛ</char></note> kale aata ni Israel nkyakaa nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Ni di Yeroboam latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ Israel baka nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Sakaria layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Asaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Di Israel ɔka Yeroboam alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-dikuɛsinle kamɛ yi, ni di Amasia obisuɔtɔbi, Asaria, Yuda ɔka lakye kasɔ aatoole sɛka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Lefosi alɛɛ akuɔ aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka. Ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ-anyɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yekolia, aakye ni Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote Amasia labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Kafɔɔ batabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu; ni di batii lakple baalaatɔɔta sele, baatɔɔfiɛ olufui ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />SAATE nwu lata ofiɛ sɛɛle lapɛ ɔka Asaria dialaase di dii le aakpi nii, ni aablasa suoto aasiɛ di leyo bamba nɛ. Ninfɛ di ɔka obisuɔtɔbi, Yotam latoonyu lɛkayo, aayila kafɔɔ di batii nwu kanya di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Di Asaria sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Ni di Asaria latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yotam layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Sakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Di Yuda ɔka Asaria alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnɛnle kamɛ yi, ni di Yeroboam obisuɔtɔbi, Sakaria labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka awɛntɛ akuɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di bate nɔɔ labla nii. Atadiɛ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, nse aata Israel labla nii.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Yabes obisuɔtɔbi, Salum lakũ kanwumbe di Sakaria suoto. Aadieko nwɔ di batii nɔɔ anu, aalo nwɔ, ni aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Bɛɛkpana Sakaria sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Nioso SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aatɔkɔ ni Yehu lawa kaanya alɛ: “Banantii lɛfɔ kamasiɛ di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto ninaadu kɔna naafa suoto.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Salum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Yabes obisuɔtɔbi, Salum labale ɔka di Yuda di ɔka Usia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwɔɔ mankple manlɛɛ Asaria nɛ</char></note> alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnaasinle kamɛ. Ni di Salum lale sɛka di Samaria kɔwɛntɛ kunwii nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Ninfɛ di Gadi obisuɔtɔbi, Menahem ladie di Tirsa aakata aakyɛ Samaria nɛ. Ni aalaadieko Yabes obisuɔtɔbi, Salum di Samaria, aalo nwɔ, ni aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Salum sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku kanwumbe ka katũ aale ni yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Menahem ladie di Tirsa aalaadieko Tifsa ku otii biala niasiɛ ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ ku mba di sɛlɔɔkɔ ninwu, ta baasĩ ni n-yoko lɛma ɔsɛkɛtɛ ɔta ma ni oso. Ni aawɔɔsa Tifsa okpoo nwu, aabɛbɛɛ bamɛlakatɛ bamuu amɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Menahem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Di Yuda ɔka Asaria alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnaasinle kamɛ, Gadi obisuɔtɔbi, Menahem labale Israel ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Samaria alɛɛ lefosi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu. Di sɛka ole nɔɔ simuu kamɛ, atadiɛ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, nse aata Israel labla nii.<verse eid="2KI 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Ninfɛ di Asiria ɔka Pul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwɔɔ mankple manlɛɛ Tiglat Pileser nɛ</char></note> lataka di kasɔ nwu suoto, ni di Menahem latɔɔ koto fututu bakilo nkpe afosi-atiɛ-bana alɛ Pul katɔɔ lɛkyakaako ankpee nwɔ osie alɛ sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ kayila kpinkpĩ. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahem lafũ koto ko mmle di Israel. Osuɔtɔ saawɛntɛ biala lakũ koto fututu afosi-anɔɔ alɛ baayɔ manta Asiria ɔka. Nioso Asiria ɔka ladie, atasinsiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Di Menahem sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya amuu aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Ni di Menahem latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Pekahia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Pekahia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Di Yuda ɔka Asaria alɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ kamɛ, ni di Menahem obisuɔtɔbi, Pekahia labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Ni di Pekahia labla okpile di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. Atadiɛ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, nse aata Israel labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Ninfɛ di ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔfo nɔɔ onwii, Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka lakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ nɛ. Aakpaa Gilead bakpɛtɛ afosi-anɔɔ aaklee, ni baalaalo Pekahia ku Argob ku Arie di lɛkayo katanikokɔ kamɛ di Samaria nɛ. Nioso Peka lalo Pekahia, ni aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Pekahia sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya amuu aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Peka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Di Yuda ɔka Asaria lɛlɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ-lɛnyɔɔfa kamɛ, ni di Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Ni aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. Atadiɛ sikpile se di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam labla nii, nse aata Israel labla nii.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Di Israel ɔka Peka obe kamɛ, Asiria ɔka Tiglat-Pileser lafũ Iyon, Abel Bet Maaka, Yanoa, Kedes ku Hasor. Aafũ Gilead ku Galilea, di Naftali kasɔ kamuu nkyakaa nii, ni aakpaa batii nwu bamuu aasifiko Asiria nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Ninfɛ di Ela obisuɔtɔbi, Hosea lakũ kanwumbe di Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka suoto nɛ. Aadieko nwɔ, aalo nwɔ, ni aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka, di Usia obisuɔtɔbi, Yotam lɛlɛɛ nɔɔ afosi-anyɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Di Peka sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yotam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Di Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Israel ɔka Peka lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ yi, ni di Usia obisuɔtɔbi, Yotam lakye kasɔ aatoole sɛka di Yuda nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ lefosi-akuɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yerusa, Sadok obisankobi aale. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote Usia labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Kafɔɔ batabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu; ni di batii lakple baalaatɔɔta sele, baatɔɔfiɛ olufui ninfa nɛ. Yotam lase SAATE nwu olekatakɔ Katoo kasɔ Kayoko nwu letofo.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Di Yotam sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, ku n-ya aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />(Di ayi nwu nkpo kamɛ, SAATE nwu lakye kasɔ aatookpee Siria ɔka, Resin ku Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka alɛ bataka bayila di Yuda suoto.) <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Ni di Yotam latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ ku mma di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ kamɛ, kuale ni ote okpoo kplɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ahas layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Ahas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Di Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka lefosi lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ, ni di Yotam obisuɔtɔbi, Ahas lakye kasɔ aatole sɛka di Yuda nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahas lafũ alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka, aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ lefosi-akuɔ. Atate fɛle ote Dawid, atabla nle niasiɛku ni di SAATE, Yaa nɔɔ anu. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Aakyɛ di Israel baka sisuku suoto, aayɔ bia obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aata ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ, aatikanko nnle be di SAATE nwu, latososa ni di Israel batii anu ayududusaa sisuku. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Aata sele, aafiɛ olufui di abatakale nwu, akpenkpe nsintɛɛ ku kowoso biala ninfukuti ni kalɔ.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Ninfɛ di Siria ɔka Resin ku Remalia obisuɔtɔbi, Peka wɔ niale ni Israel ɔka lakata baakyɛ baalaakpɛ Yerusalem nɛ. Baamana Ahas baakyi, kafɔɔ batafuo nwɔ olenkee. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Siria ɔka, Resin latososa Yuda bakpɛtɛ, ni aakple aafũ Elat aata Siria nɛ. Ninfɛ di Edom batii ladie baasifi Elat baalaasiɛ ninfa diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ni di Ahas lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ baalaatɔkɔ Asiria ɔka, Tiglat-Pileser alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ ku obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ nle. Wa fabafũ mi di Siria ɔka ku Israel ɔka, ninkodie ko mi ni nnɛɛ.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ninfɛ di Ahas layɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ko aanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo asaakatɛkɔ aakyɛnko Asiria ɔka fɛ akyɛsaa nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Ni di Asiria ɔka latuna aalaadieko Damasko aafũ nwu nɛ. Aadiki okpoo nwu batii aasifiko Kir, ni aalo Resin nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Ahas lakyɛ Damasko aalaakyakako Asiria ɔka Tiglat-Pileser nɛ. Aanya oleɔta akyikye anwii di Damasko, ni aayɔ oleɔta akyikye nwu letembi kɔkpana ku mmle kanya mampɛ nya manfenko ni aakyesee oletatɛ nɔɔfo Uria nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Nioso oletatɛ nɔɔfo Uria lapɛ oleɔta akyikye nwu ku letembi le okle kanya di Ɔka Ahas lakyesee nwɔ aakyeko ni Damasko. Ni aaloo nya ɔpɛ fiɛ di Ɔka Ahas lakple aawa nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Obe wɔ di ɔka lakple ni di Damasko, aawa aabanya ni oleɔta akyikye nwu yi, ni aakyɛ aalaata asaaɔta ninya suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Aata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta nɔɔ, aanyɛɛnɛ nta asaaɔta nɔɔ, aanwanwanyi atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta nɔɔ ntɔ̀ di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Ni aalaayɔ abɔɔsaa oleɔta akyikye ya niayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anu- di oleɔta akyikye fɔle ku SAATE nwu olekatakɔ obo- di n-ya aase ni di olekatakɔ nwu fɔle katoo kasɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="2KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Ahas lata oletatɛ afiofa ya mmle alɛ: “Di oleɔta akyikye kplɛ fɔle nwu suoto faata olesɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta ku kɔtɔɔfɔ alesaa asaaɔta, ɔka ofiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta nɔɔ ku batii nwu bamuu kaasɔ suoto ofiɛ asaaɔta ku alesaa asaaɔta lɛma ku nta asaaɔta ɔta lɛma. Faanwanwanyi ofiɛ asaaɔta ku oleɔta ntɔ nwu mmuu di oleɔta akyikye suoto. Kafɔɔ kamayɔ abɔɔsaa oleɔta akyikye nwu ntɔɔkaalaa asaa.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Ni di oletatɛ nɔɔfo Uria labla fɛ mmle kanya di Ɔka Ahas ladiki nwɔ ni kanya nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Ni di Ɔka Ahas labɔkɔtɛ sɛlɔɔkɔ sewoso, aatekete kafɔɔ bɛɛsi nwu di atikasaa ya mankyisa ni suoto. Ni aatekete Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu di abɔɔsaa banankyue-suɔtɔ ba niasiɛ ni kaalɔ nini, ni aayɔ aatika di afuɔ kayiɛkuu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Ni aakpa Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi akpanta ya baapɛ ni di lɛkayo nwu, aakpakpaa kafɔɔ ɔka kayoko ka di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kayi, ta aayɔ dibu anta ni Asiria ɔka oso.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Di Ahas sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ni di Ahas latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ ku mma di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Hesekia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Hosea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Di Yuda ɔka Ahas lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ yi, ni di Ela obisuɔtɔbi, Hosea labale Israel ɔka di Samaria, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ anaasĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, kafɔɔ ditate fɛle Israel baka ba niale nwɔ ni katũ.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Ni di Asiria ɔka Salmaneser lataka di Hosea suoto, ni aabakple Salmaneser kpɛmblatɛ, aatɔɔta kɔsɔsĩ aatɔɔtɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Kafɔɔ Asiria ɔka lanya alɛ okpoo biɛtɛ di Hosea lale, diekye aakpee batii baakyɛ Egipte ɔka So nfũ, ni atasintɔɔta kɔsɔsĩ atɔɔta Asiria ɔka fɛ mmle aatɔɔbla ni lɛlɛɛ biala nɛ. Nioso Salmaneser lamufũ Hosea aalaatɛ di leyo katenkɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaria Kanɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Ninfɛ di Asiria ɔka lakata aakyɛ kasɔ nwu kamuu aalaadieko Samaria okpoo, baamana nwu baakyi alɛɛ atiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Di Hosea lɛlɛɛ nansinle kamɛ yi, Asiria ɔka lafũ Samaria, ni aadiki Israel batii bamuu aasifiko Asiria nɛ. Ni aalaasiɛsa ma di Hala di Gosan di Habor Okle-lɔɔkɔ ku Media sekpoo nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />N-ya mmle amuu lawa ta mmle di Israel batii labla ni okpile di SAATE, Yaa lɛma suoto. Nnwɔ niakpaa ma aadieko ni di Egipte, di Egipte ɔka Farao osie nwu kalɔ. Baasumu bayaa bamba, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />baatikanko nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa ni di anu lɛma sɛsaabla, ku sɛsaabla se di Israel baka latɛ nii. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Israel batii labla asaa di lewofa kamɛ di SAATE, Yaa lɛma suoto, atasiɛko nii. Baatofo ntakalekɔ di sekpoo nwu simuu kamɛ baata suoto lɛma. Diayɔ ni di lɛbatakale le manyila man-nyu ni dialaadu ni okpoo kplɛ wɔ baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa nii. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Baatɛ afiɔtii ku afiɔ ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni Asera sewoso di lekpenkpe biala ku kowoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Di katakalekɔ biala, baafiɛ olufui fɛ mmle di nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa ni di anu lɛma labla nii. Baabla ansiesiensaa ya niata ɔblɔ lafiɛ ni SAATE nwu. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Baasumu afiɔ, nu di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Bitambla nle mmle.” <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />SAATE nwu lasĩ ɔlaa aata Israel ku Yuda, diafe ni di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ku asaa banyatɛ nɔɔ suoto alɛ: “Bidiɛ ɔkyɛ di sisuku kpile lee nwu suoto. Bile afiofa ku sɛsaabla nii, di mmle dikaatɛ ni ku Afiofa ya amuu latɔkɔ ni bate lee, layɔ lata ye ni diafe ni di bakpɛmblatɛ ku Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nii suoto.”<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Kafɔɔ batanu, ni baale batokopĩtɛ fɛ bate lɛma ba nitatika ni disi di SAATE, Yaa lɛma suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Baasĩ sɛsaabla nɔɔ ku kanya ninii le aabla ni ku bate lɛma ku ɔlaa wɔ aasĩ aata ma nii. Baatikanko afiɔ ya ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ, ni di mma kafɔɔ baabakple mba ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ nɛ. Baanyunko nnle be niamana ma diakyi nii, nu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitambla fɛ mmle bɔɔbla nii,” ni baabla asaa ya di SAATE nwu latĩi ma osuku alɛ batambla ni nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Baasĩ SAATE, Yaa lɛma afiofa amuu, ni baabla afiɔ anyɔ, baabla ni di anankyuebi letembi kanya ku Asera sewoso baata suoto lɛma nɛ. Ni baawakasɔ baata osi asaa amuu, baasumu Baal nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Baayɔ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma baata ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ. Baatɔɔpɛ sɛbɔ, baatɔɔbla afasaa, baasunsũ suoto lɛma kafɔɔ baata sikpile ɔbla di SAATE nwu anu, baata ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Nioso ɔblɔ lafiɛ SAATE nwu, ni aakyisa ma di anu nɔɔ nɛ. Yuda kɔna lete niabu, <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />bia Yuda ditale SAATE, Yaa lɛma afiofa nwu. Baatikanko sɛsaabla se di Israel latɛ nii. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Nioso SAATE nwu lasĩ Israel batii bamuu; aata diabuo ma, ni aayɔ ma aakpee di asaa-balalaasatɛ nnɛɛ, dialaase di obe wɔ aawɔɔsa ma ni di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lablasa ni Israel di Dawid leyo suoto yi, ni baayɔ Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam baase ɔka lɛma nɛ. Yeroboam latososa Israel di SAATE nwu otikanko suoto, ni aata ma baabla okpile kplɛ onwii nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Israel batii latikanko Yeroboam sikpile simuu, batadiɛ sĩ ɔbla <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />dialaase di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lakyisa ma ni di anu nɔɔ, fɛ mmle aasĩ ɔlaa aata ma diafe ni di bakpɛmblatɛ ku Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu suoto. Nioso baakpaa Israel batii baadieko di kale lɛma kasɔ baasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ di Asiria kasɔ, ni beekple bakpe ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asiria Batii Labasiɛ Di Israel Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Ninfɛ di Asiria ɔka lakyeko batii Babel, Kuta, Awa, Hamat ku Sefarwaim aabasiɛsa ma di Samaria sekpoo kamɛ di Israel batii kasiɛkɔ nɛ. Baafũ Samaria, ni baasiɛ di sekpoo ninwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Di obe wɔ baasiɛ ni ninfa lɛkasale yi, batasumu SAATE nwu; nioso SAATE nwu ladiki bakyata aakpee kaamɛ lɛma, ni baaloloo batii bawo nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Ni baatɔkɔ Asiria ɔka alɛ, “Batii ba fɛɛkpaa fɛɛlaasiɛsa ni di Samaria sekpoo nwu kamɛ dieye kale nwu yaa kufiofa. Nioso atoodiki bakyata eekpee kaamɛ lɛma, boololoo ma nɛ, diekye batii nwu dieye kasɔ nwu yaa kufiofa.”<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Ninfɛ di Asiria ɔka nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bita olebatatɛ ba biemufũ biekyeko ni Samaria onwii lɛma akple asifi alaasiɛ ninfa, aatuo batii nwu kasɔ nwu yaa kufiofa.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Nioso oletatɛ onwii niasiɛ ni di sɛlanle kamɛ, aakye ni Samaria lawa aabasiɛ di Betel, ni aatuo ma mmle mansumu ni SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Kafɔɔ kale biala dikudi labla bayaa lɛma bamu di sekpoo kpinwu di nfũ baasiɛ nii. Ni baayɔ nya baatɛ di nfiofa be di Samaria batii latɛ ni di ntakalekɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Ninfɛ di batii ba niakye ni Babel labla Sukot Benot, Kut batii labla Nergal, Hamat batii labla Asima; <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Awi batii labla Nibhas ku Tartak, ni di Sefarwi batii lafĩɛ babi lɛma di ɔtɔ kamɛ fɛ ole bɛɛta ni Adramelek ku Anamelek, bale ni Sefarwaim bayaa. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Baasumu SAATE nwu, kafɔɔ batii nwu ladiki batii lɛma bamu kpinwu alɛ babla olebatatɛ ɔkpɛ di nfiofa nwu di ntakalekɔ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Baasumu SAATE nwu, kafɔɔ baakple baasumu mma bamu bayaa, di nnle be kamɛ baakpaa ma baakyeko ni sɛsaabla osuku kanya.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Beekple bakle okle sɛsaabla lɛma kofole se mmle diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle. Batasumu SAATE nwu ee bakyɛ di sisuku ku kanya ninii, afiofa ku sɛsaabla se di SAATE nwu lata ni Yakob banantii ba aata ni leyooto alɛ Israel. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Di SAATE nwu lanii ni kanya ku Israel batii yi, aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitansumu bayaa bamba kuonwii ee biawakasɔ biata ma, biatɔ ma ee biata sele ɔta biata ma. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Kafɔɔ SAATE wɔ niakpaa ye aadieko ni di Egipte ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ osie ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi ninle nnwɔ dikpeni biesumu nɛ. Nnwɔɔ bibawakasɔ, minta ole kafɔɔ minta nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Obe lele bilolaa binyu bilɛ biɛkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ, biemufũ kanya ninii, afiofa ku sɛsaabla se aakpana aata ye ni bieklee. Bitansumu bayaa bamba. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Bitan-yee kanya ka lanii ni ku aye, batasumu kafɔɔ bayaa bamba. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Kafɔɔ, bisumu SAATE, Yaa lee; nnwɔɔ ninle nwɔ nimadiki ye ni di balo lee bamuu nnɛɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Kafɔɔ batanu, baakple baatɔɔbla sɛsaabla lɛma kofole nwu. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Bia di batii ba mmle latoosumu ni SAATE nwu yi, baatɔɔtɔ afiɔ bamba. Diɛbadu ni miɛ dii le mmle, babi ku bawa lɛma kokple mambla fɛ mmle di bate lɛma labla nii.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Hesekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Di Israel ɔka Ela obisuɔtɔbi, Hosea lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ yi, ni di Yuda ɔka niale ni Ahas obisuɔtɔbi, Hesekia lakye kasɔ aatoole sɛka nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka. Ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anaasĩ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Abi nɛ, Sakaria obisankobi aale. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Aabla lɛsaa le niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote Dawid labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Aabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu, aakpakpaa afiɔtii, aabubudi Asera sewoso nwu. Aabibiɛ lɛbɔɔsaa kɔsaanwu ko di Mose labla ni wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ. Diekye diabadu ni obe nwu kamɛ Israel batii latoofiɛ olufui baatɔɔta kũ. (Baatɔɔlɛɛ kũ alɛ Nahustan.)<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hesekia latika disi di SAATE, Israel Yaa suoto. Kuonwii ditawɛ fɛle nnwɔɔ okle di Yuda baka bamuu kamɛ, bia mba niale nwɔ ni katũ ee mba sɛɛmaa nɔɔ. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Aamufũ SAATE nwu aaklee kpinkpĩ, atadiɛ nwɔ otikanko; aale SAATE nwu afiofa ya di Mose lata nii. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Ni di SAATE nwu lasiɛko nwɔ nɛ. Lɛsaa lele kafɔɔ aabla, lalɛ ɔkyɛ diatɔɔ. Aataka aayila di Asiria ɔka suoto, ni atasumu nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Diayɔ ni di lɛba takale le manyila man-nyu ni, dialaadu ni okpoo kplɛ wɔ baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa nii, aalenkee Filisti batii dialaadu bia Gasa okpoo kplɛ ku sekpoo se niamana nwu kuakyi nii.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Di Ɔka Hesekia lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ, diale ni Israel ɔka Ela obisuɔtɔbi, Hosea lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle yi, ni di Asiria ɔka, Salmaneser lataka di Samaria suoto, ni baamana nwu baakyi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Di lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kayɛntɛkɔ, Asiria batii lafũ okpoo nwu. Nioso baafũ Samaria di Hesekia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ kuɔnle kamɛ, diale ni Israel ɔka Hosea lɛlɛɛ naasinle kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Ni di Asiria ɔka lakpaa Israel batii aasifiko aalaasiɛsa ma di Hala okpoo, di Gosan di Habor Okle-lɔɔkɔ ku Media sekpoo kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Nle mmle lawa ta batakyɔɔ ni SAATE, Yaa lɛma ɔlaa atoko, kafɔɔ baasĩ ni kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu- kufiofa ko kumuu di SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ Mose labuɛ nii. Batakyɔɔ afiofa nwu atoko ee bale nya.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asiria Batii Layɛkɛsa Yerusalem Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Di Ɔka Hesekia lefosi lɛlɛɛ naafa sɛka ole kamɛ yi, Asiria ɔka Senakerib lataka di Yuda sekpoo kplɛ se baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa ni simuu, ni baafũ sĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Nioso Yuda ɔka Hesekia lata Asiria ɔka kanya ka mmle di Lakis alɛ: “Lɛbla okpile. Kple nkpaamaa di suoto nii, kamata fɔ kɔsɔsĩ lele fɛɛkaalɛ mi.” Ni di Asiria ɔka latɔkɔ Yuda ɔka Hesekia alɛ atɔɔ koto fututu bakilo nkpe nnaasĩ ku koto sɛɛle bakilo afosi-anaasĩ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Nioso Hesekia layɔ koto fututu ko kumuu baanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo asaakatɛkɔ kamɛ aatɔɔ.<verse eid="2KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Yuda ɔka Hesekia lakpakpaa koto sɛɛle ko aayɔ aakakaasa ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ akloo ku akloo sewoso suoto, ninfɛ aayɔ aata Asiria ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Senakerib Layɛkɛsa Yerusalem Nkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Ni di Asiria ɔka lakpee bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ ɔnɔɔfo-nɔɔfo, banɔɔfotii ɔnɔɔfo ku bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ ɔlambu baakye Lakis baakyɛ Ɔka Hesekia nfũ di Yerusalem nɛ. Baadu ni Yerusalem, baayila di kawaalɛkɔ nwu di Katoo Lɛpanta katũ, di Asaa-fototɛ Kofe osuku kanya. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Ni baalɛɛ ɔka Hesekia aawa nɛ; ninfɛ di lɛkayo asaa nyuntɛ wɔ niale ni Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi, Eliakim ku kukũ kpanatɛ Sebna ku Asaf obisuɔtɔbi, Yoa wɔ niale ni asaakatɛkɔ nsũtɛtɛ ladie baakyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Ni di bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ Hesekia bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2KI 18:19">“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kplɛ, Asiria ɔka kobuɛ ni alɛ: Obe lɛsaa suoto feetika disi lɛfɔ? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Foobuɛ falɛ fakpe sisuku se mankpɛ ni kakpɛ ku bakpɛtɛ osie- kafɔɔ kanya fukuti lete foobuɛ. Owe suoto feetika disi oso fɛɛtaka fayɛ mi di suoto? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Nyu lo, Egipte feetika disi, okpoku feele nwu, nintofo ni otii kɔɔnɛɛ, kuntika nwɔ ni kakɔ nse ɛɛkpɛ ninwu suoto! Nkpo di Egipte ɔka Farao nte ata batii ba bamuu nietika nwɔ ni disi nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Ni nse fɛɛtɔkɔ mi falɛ, “SAATE, Yaa loo nwu buotika disi”- ni diele nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ ntakalekɔ ku oleɔta akyikye di Hesekia ntoobibiɛ, ɛɛtɔkɔ ni Yuda ku Yerusalem alɛ, “Dikpe ni biesumu ni di oleɔta akyikye ya mmle katũ”?<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />“ ‘Kanua wa, biebuɛ ku saate nii Asiria ɔka: Kamata fɔ bapɔnkɔ nkpe nnyɔ- nse fabafuo basiɛtɛ ɔwɛ ɔta ma! <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Ni lɛ nfɛ fabafuo kakpɛ ɔnɔɔfo onwii wɔ ninle ni obiibii di saate nii bakpɛtɛ kamɛ olenkee, fiɛ bia di Egipte feetika ni disi falɛ ata fɔ ni bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Diɛkyakaa nii, ntodiwa lɛbakpɛ, lɛwɔɔsa kafɔɔ lɛba le mmle, di ɔlaa kuonwii ditakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ? SAATE nwu omu niɛtɔkɔ mi alɛ nkyɛ ninaadieko kale nwu ninwɔɔsa ka.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Ninfɛ di Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi, Eliakim ku Sebna ku Yoa latɔkɔ bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu alɛ, “Lekoto, kakatɛko bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ di Arameik sele kamɛ, diekye nsĩ buonu nɛ. Tankakatɛko wo di Hebri sele kamɛ, di mmle di batii ba di oyoyiɛ suoto dilɔbanu nii.”<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bienyu bilɛ saate lee ku aye lete ɔkyɛ di saate nii lekpee mi alɛ matɔkɔ ye sɛlaa se mmle, ni diele ku mba ninsi ni di oyoyiɛ suoto- mba ninte ni fɛle aye, babale ni mma bamu mmbi, mannyi ni kafɔɔ mma bamu kɔsɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ninfɛ di bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu lataka aayila aafaa di Hebri sele kamɛ aabuɛ alɛ: “Binu Asiria ɔka kplɛ ɔlaa! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitanta Hesekia lakyɔnkyɔ ye. Ɔlɔbafuo ye ofũ di nnɛɛ nii. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Bitanta Hesekia lata ye biatika disi di SAATE nwu suoto, di obe wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Nwaako, SAATE nwu kamadiki wo nii; blɔbayɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle bakpee di Asiria nnɛɛ.’<verse eid="2KI 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />“Batannu Hesekia. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Asiria ɔka kobuɛ ni: Bibla atoko ɔkyɔ ole ku ami, biedie biwa ɔkyɛ nii. Ni obiala lee kamale di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ nta awosobi kofe ku abue-woso nɔɔ, annyi ntu kafɔɔ di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ntu dibiɔ kamɛ, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />ninaase di obe wɔ kamawa mmakpaa ye nsifiko ni kasɔ ka ninte ni fɛle kale ye kamu okle. Atitabi ku nta fɔle kasɔ, alesaa ku nta awosobi kasɔ, nnɔnyi awoso ku bablɔ kasɔ. Bidiki nkpa, kafɔɔ diele kukpi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 18:32">“Bitannu Hesekia, diekye ɔɔkyɔnkyɔ ye, nse eebuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu kamadiki wo.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Kale kawo yaa ntodifũ kasɔ nɔɔ eekyeko Asiria ɔka nnɛɛ? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Ɔfɛ di Hamat ku Arpad bayaa nkpe? Ɔfɛ di Sefarwaim, Hena ku Iwa bayaa nkpe? Batoofũ Samaria di nnɛɛ nii? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Di nnle be mmle bayaa nwu bamuu kamɛ, ɔmɛnle lɛma nintoofuo kasɔ nɔɔ ofũ di nnɛɛ nii?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Kafɔɔ batii nwu lalokanana, batadiki kanya, diekye ɔka Hesekia latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitandiki ɔlaa nɔɔ kanya.”<verse eid="2KI 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Ninfɛ di lɛkayo asaa nyuntɛ wɔ niale ni Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi, Eliakim ku kukũ kpanatɛ Sebna ku Asaf obisuɔtɔbi, Yoa wɔ niale ni asaakatɛkɔ nsũtɛtɛ ladie baakyɛ Hesekia nfũ ku akpeele lɛma bɛbɛɛle, baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa wɔ di bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu labuɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Hesekia Lakaalɛ Yesaya Disibu Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Obe wɔ di Ɔka Hesekia lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, ni aanyukũ leboko, aasifi SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Ni aakpee Eliakim wɔ niale ni lɛkayo asaa nyuntɛ, kukũ kpanatɛ Sebna ku olebatatɛ batunletɛ, baanyukũ aboko baakyɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yesaya wɔ niale ni Amos obisuɔtɔbi nfũ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Ni baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Hesekia kobuɛ ni alɛ: Miɛ dii le mmle nle nimiina ku ɔlaa osĩ ɔta ku sinunsɔ dii, fɛ mmle nse boolofo obisɔ di ɔnyɛɛ nsinnaa baakɔɔsĩ nwɔ mandiki nii. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Loobia SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ nwu manu sɛlaa se di bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu, nnwɔ di saate nɔɔ Asiria ɔka nwu lekpee, ɛɛbakpee ni Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa oyududu. Mmle aasĩ ɔlaa antɔɔ ni ta sɛlaa se di SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ nwu ntoonu ni oso. Nioso pɛ ɔlaa fata mba niebu basi ni nkpa.”<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Obe wɔ di Ɔka Hesekia banɔɔfotii lakyɛ ni Yesaya nfũ, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />Yesaya latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ saate lee bilɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitanyɛkɛ sɛlaa se di Asiria ɔka batɔkyɛntɛ lɛbabuɛ beekpee mi ni oyududu bienu nii. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Binu! Kamayɔ ninwuna ninwii nkpee nwɔ kaamɛ, alɛ nse eenu ɔlaa owo abakple ansifi kale nɔɔ kamu, nfa nfɛ kamata manlo nwɔ ku kapamii nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ lanu alɛ Asiria ɔka ntoosifi ni Lakis yi, aakple nkpaamaa, ni aanya alɛ ɔka nwu kɔkpɛko Libna nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Ninfɛ di ɔka Senakerib lafũ kanya alɛ Tirhaka, Kus otii nwu niale ni Egipte ɔka ladie oofe alɛ ɔɔlaakpɛko nwɔ nɛ. Nioso aakple aakpee batɔkyɛntɛ di Hesekia nfũ ku ɔlaa wɔ mmle alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Tɔkɔ Yuda ɔka Hesekia falɛ: Tanta yaa nwu feetika ni disi lakyɔnkyɔ fɔ di obe wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Blɔbayɔ Yerusalem bakpee ni di Asiria ɔka nnɛɛ.’ <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Nwaako fatoonu mmle di Asiria baka labla ni nnle nwu mmuu, baawɔɔsa mi ni fɛɛ. Ni babadiki fɔ? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Nnle be di bawa nii lawɔɔsa ni bayaa ladiki ma: Gosan, Haran, Resef ku Eden batii ba niawɛ ni di Tel Asar? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Ɔfɛ di Hamat ɔka, Arpad ɔka, Sefarwaim okpoo kplɛ ɔka ee Hena ɔka ee Iwa ɔka nkpe?”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Hesekia lafũ kukũ nwu aakyeko batɔkyɛntɛ nwu nfũ, ni aaka kũ nɛ. Ninfɛ aakata aasifi SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, aalaafukuti kũ aatɛ di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Ni di Hesekia lapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu alɛ: “Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, foole ni sɛka di bakarubim obo, lete lɛfɔ ninle Yaa di sɛka nlekɔ mmuu di kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Kyɔɔ kotoko, faanu, Oo SAATE; tikiti anu, faanya, Oo SAATE; nu sɛlaa se di Senakerib lekyesee, ootufa ni Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="2KI 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />“Oo SAATE, nwaako Asiria batii baka lɛwɔɔsa nnle be mmle ku nsɔ lɛma. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Beefuki bayaa lɛma nwu beekpee di ɔtɔ kamɛ, bɛɛwɔɔsa ma. Diekye batale bayaa, kafɔɔ awosoku ku afuɔ aale, ablasaa aale ku batii nnɛɛ. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Oo SAATE, Yaa loo, kanunua diki wo di nnɛɛ nɔɔ, di mmle di sɛka nlekɔ nwu mmuu di kasɔ suoto kamatofo ni alɛ lete lɛfɔ, Oo SAATE, ninle ni Yaa.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesaya Lafũ Ɔlaa Aakyeko Yaa Nfũ Aakyɛnko Ɔka Hesekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Ninfɛ di Amos obisuɔtɔbi, Yesaya lata kanya baakyɛnko Hesekia alɛ: “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ntoonu ɔlaa lɛfɔ wɔ fɛɛpɛ ni di Asiria ɔka Senakerib suoto. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu lebuɛ eeyila nwɔ ni di suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">“ ‘Sion Obisankobi Kakpeelebitɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">lenyu fɔ nyakatãa, ɔɔma fɔ kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Yerusalem Obisankobi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">kotukunsa disi nɔɔ, footoso nii.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Owe feetufa, feekpee sinunsɔ kafɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Owe fɛɛtakatɛsa sɛlɔ feemuɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">fɛɛtakatɛsa anu kafɔɔ feenyu ku lɛkanta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Di Israel Klekletɛ nwu suoto fɛɛtaka fayɛ!<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Feefe di batɔkyɛntɛ lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">feetufa SAATE nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Ni faabuɛ falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">“Ku bakeke nii ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">lɛkata lɛkyɛ abokote nsintɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">Lebanon katakalekɔ yɛntɛle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Lebudi sedar awoso nɔɔ takale lɛtɛ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ku awoso siene biene nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Lɛlaadu katakalekɔ kyonle nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ku apoo biene nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Lakutu ntu abiɔ di bafɔɔ nsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">lanyi ntu nwu ninfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Layɔ nkpaasɔ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">lata Egipte koklenyii simuu lasɔɔ.”<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />“ ‘Fadinu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Bia saa latɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Di saa obe labla disibu nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">mianwu ntɔɔta diɛwa kaanya nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">alɛ faabiɛ sekpoo kplɛ siene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">sinkple siyiɛkuu.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Batii lɛma dilabawɛ ɔnyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">dibabla ma ɔkpɛ, manfũ sinunsɔ kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bate fɛle alesaa koofe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">niɛkɔntɔ ni sɛfɔle, sɛfɔle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">fɛle sɛfa ninkɔkɔntɔ ni di leyo osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">sin-yɔɔ ni fiɛ simamuɔ nii.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ n-ye nfũ fasi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ku obe wɔ fanwa fansifi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ku mmle fɛɛtaka fayɛ mi ni di suoto.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Ta fɛɛtaka fayɛ mi ni di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">di suoto katoo lɛfɔ ɔtakatɛsa ntoodu ni atoko nii kafɔɔ oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">kamayɔ lɛkɔnii nii nkpee fɔ di onwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">n-yɔ ofutuwɛ nii kafɔɔ ntũ fɔ kaanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">nta fɔ fankple fansifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">di osuku wɔ feefe fɛɛwa nii.’<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />“Oo Hesekia: Nle mmle nimale fɔ nsũ lɛtɛsaa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">“Lɛlɛɛ le mmle bibale asaa ya di nnya amu niɛkɔntɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kafɔɔ diputu kamɛ ale bibale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Kafɔɔ lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa bibapɛ asaa minfee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">bibakpɛ nta awosobi afe, minle nya abi.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Diɛkyakaa nii, mba niebu ni di Yuda leyo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">kamase sidu kaasɔ mantika kafɔɔ abi di osi.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Diekye batii bule kamadie mankye Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">mba niawɛ ni nkpa dikudi madie mankye Sion Kobokote.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2KI 19:31">SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni okyiini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">nimabla nle mmle.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni di Asiria ɔka suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">“Ɔlɔbabuo okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">ee ataa kɔtaa kukunwii ninfũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">Ɔlɔbawa nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ ku kubidifunsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">ee amana nwu akyi.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Osuku wɔ suoto eefe ɛɛwa nii, nnwu nwu suoto abakple ansifi nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">ɔlɔbabuo okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle,”</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2KI 19:33">SAATE nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />“Kamayila okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamaa ndiki nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">ta leyooto nii ku kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid leyooto oso.”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu tɔkyɛntɛ lakyɛ aalaalo batii nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anɛ-banɔɔ di Asiria batii kasikɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ di mba niabu ni lasɛnkɛ ni ku olesɛ- mba niate ni bamuu ntookple bakpi! <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Nioso Asiria ɔka, Senakerib layɔ asaa aakple nkpaamaa. Ni aakple aasifi Ninewe aalaasiɛ ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Dii ninwii, obe wɔ aatoosumu ni di Nisrok yaa olekatakɔ yi, babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Adramelek ku Sareser, lalo nwɔ ku kapamii baatɛ, ni baatoso baasifi Ararat kasɔ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Esarhadon layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Hesekia Ofiɛ Ku Ɔtaka Di Ofiɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Di ayi nwu nkpo kamɛ, Hesekia labuo ofiɛ, aaloo ni okpi. Ni di Amos obisuɔtɔbi, Yesaya, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ lakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ aalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni: Lolaa leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ asaa fatɛ, diekye fɔɔwa ɔbakpi; flɔbataka di ofiɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Ninfɛ di Hesekia lamunikĩisa anu aakyɔɔ oyoyiɛ, ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata SAATE nwu aabuɛ alɛ, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“Oo SAATE, nyuma mmle lakyɛ ni ku onukwale di anu lɛfɔ ku otu wɔ niawo ni nimu, labla lɛsaa le kafɔɔ nialɛ ni di anu lɛfɔ.” Ninfɛ di Hesekia lawi kaku blɔblɔblɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Fiɛ di Yesaya ladie ni di kaflɔnkɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Yesaya alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Kple faalatɔkɔ Hesekia, batii nii tunletɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu, teete lɛfɔ Dawid Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ntoonu fɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ, lɛnya kafɔɔ nnumɛɛ lɛfɔ; kamakya fɔ ofiɛ. Diɛyɔ ni kanunua, di dii tiɛfa suoto fabakata fankyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Ni kamakyakaa fɔ alɛɛ lefosi-anɔɔ di nkpa lɛfɔ suoto. Kamadiki fɔ ku okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nkyeko Asiria ɔka nnɛɛ. Kamayila okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamaa, ta leyooto nii ku kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid leyooto oso.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Ninfɛ di Yesaya labuɛ alɛ, “Bikuɔ abuɛ leboo.” Ni baabla nkpo, baayɔ baatika di didiesaa nwu, ni aawɛ ofiɛkya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Ni di Hesekia lakaalɛ Yesaya alɛ, “Obe nimale dituosaa alɛ SAATE nwu kamakya mi ofiɛ, ntaka nkyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di dii tiefa suoto diɛyɔ ni di nunua?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Ninfɛ di Yesaya ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nnya SAATE nwu dituosaa diɛta fɔ ni alɛ, SAATE nwu kamabla di ɔlaa wɔ eebuɛ ɛɛtɛ ni kanya: Kunyii kukpukuti kunkyɛ sitũ, nkpaa didiki lefosi, sɛɛ kunkyɛ sɛmaa nkpaa didiki lefosi?”<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />“Ni di Hesekia labuɛ alɛ, “Ɔlaa kakuu kule kuɔta alɛ, kunyii lɛkyɛ sitũ nkpaa didiki lefosi, ninlenkee alɛ kuakyɛ sɛmaa nkpaa didiki lefosi.” <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabutɛtɛ Yesaya lalɛɛ SAATE nwu nɛ, ni di SAATE nwu lata kunyii lakpukuti kuakyɛ sɛmaa nkpaa didiki lefosi be aasoo aakyɛ ni di Ahas nkyodiɛ suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batɔkyɛntɛ Lakye Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ Babel ɔka Merodak-Baladan, niale ni Baladan obisuɔtɔbi lakyesee Hesekia akũ ku lɛkyɛsaa, diekye aanu Hesekia ofiɛ. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hesekia lafũ batɔkyɛntɛ nwu, ni aatuo ma asaa ya amuu niate ni di asaa nɔɔ katɛkɔ ayo kamɛ nɛ- koto fututu, koto sɛɛle, asaa kɔnɔkɔnɔ, nnɔnyi biene- akpɛsaa nɔɔ ku lɛsaa biala niate ni di asaa katɛkɔ nɔɔ. Lɛsalɛsaa kuniwii nnaa di lɛkayo nɔɔ ee di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ kamuu kamɛ di Hesekia ditatuo ma nii.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yesaya lakyɛ Ɔka Hesekia nfũ aalaakaalɛ alɛ, “Be di basuɔtɔ nwu lebuɛ, ɔfɛ kafɔɔ beekye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">Ninfɛ di Hesekia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Beekye kasɔ fanfa, beekye Babel bɛɛwa.”<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lakaalɛ alɛ, “Be lɛsaa bɛɛnya di lɛkayo lɛfɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Ni di Hesekia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bɛɛnya lɛsaa biala di lɛkayo nii kamɛ, lɛsalɛsaa nnaa di asaa nii katɛkɔ ninantuo ma nii.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Ninfɛ di Yesaya latɔkɔ Hesekia alɛ, “Nu SAATE nwu ɔlaa: <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Obe kamawa babatuka ni lɛsaa biala di lɛkayo lɛfɔ ku n-ya amuu di bate lɛfɔ lekookaa ni diɛbadu ni miɛ, mansifiko Babel. Lɛsalɛsaa dilababu, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Banantii lɛfɔ bawo, afɔ omu ntɔ babi ba babalofo manta fɔ nii, babakpaa ma mansifiko, manaakple asaa banyuntɛ di Babel ɔka lɛkayo.”<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Ninfɛ di Hesekia ladiki kanya alɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ feebuɛ ni nlɛ.” Diekye aanyu alɛ, “Atoko ɔkyɛ ole ku katĩtĩi dilɔbawɛ di nkpa nii osiɛbee kamɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hesekia Sɛka Ole Kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Di sɛsaabla bamba di Hesekia sɛka ole kamɛ, asaa ya amuu aafuo ni ɔbla ku mmle aabla ni ntu lɛpanta ku ntu osuku odiki niata alɛ ntu lawa ni okpoo kplɛ nwu yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Ni di Hesekia latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Manase layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase lafũ alɛɛ lefosi anyɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anɔɔ-anɔɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Hefsiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Ni aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, aatikanko ayududusaa ya di nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa ni di Israel batii anu sɛsaabla. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Aase ntakalekɔ be di ote Hesekia labibiɛ ni letofo; aakple aapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata Baal, aase kafɔɔ Asera owoso, fɛ mmle di Israel ɔka Ahab labla nii. Ni baawakasɔ baata osi asaa amuu, baasumu nya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Aapɛ oleɔta akyikye di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ka suoto di SAATE nwu labuɛ ni alɛ, “Di Yerusalem kamatɛ Leyooto nii.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nflɔnkɔ nwu nnyɔ yi, aapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata osi asaa amuu. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Aayɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ aata ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ, aatɔɔbla afasaa, sɛbɔ ɔkpɛ, asaa ɔkaalɛ ku anwuna kamɛ sɛsaabla. Aale sikpile kpinwu di SAATE nwu anu, aata ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="2KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Ni aayɔ Asera owoso wɔ aawola ni aalaatɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ka di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Dawid ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon alɛ, “Di olekatakɔ ka mmle ku Yerusalem, lediki ni di Israel ana amuu kamɛ, kamatɛ Leyooto nii dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Namasinta Israel batii kafɔɔ bakyɛ bakyi di kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lɛma, nse babalolaa mannyu, mambla kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le lɛtɔkɔ ma nii, manle kafɔɔ Afiofa nii amuu ya di kpɛmblatɛ nii Mose lata ma nii.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Kafɔɔ batii nwu ditanu. Manase lata ma baayu osuku, nioso baabla sikpile kpinwu baalenkee nnle be di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ni di Israel batii anu.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko di bakpɛmblatɛ ku Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ suoto alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Yuda ɔka Manase lɛbla ayududusaa sikpile se mmle. Eele sikpile kpinwu alenke Amori batii ba niale nwɔ ni katũ, ni aaleko Yuda katũ di sikpile ku afiɔ nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Nioso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamayɔ ɔlaa kpile nwako di Yerusalem ku Yuda suoto alɛ otii biala atoko ya ni ma nu nwu ni kamatũtũkũ. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Kamayɔ lɛklapoosaa okũ wɔ layɔ ni di Samaria suoto ku kamantĩ okũ wɔ layɔ ni di Ahab leyo suoto ntika di Yerusalem suoto. Kamasunsú Yerusalem kundie fɛ mmle di otii nsunsú ni kasɛfɛ, ansunsú ka an-yɔ anfuusa ni kaasɔ. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Kamasĩ atesaa nii ya niebu nii, nin-yɔ ma nkpee di balo lɛma nnɛɛ. Balo lɛma kamayu ma, manlɛ kafɔɔ asaa lɛma mansifiko. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Diekye bɛɛbla okpile di anu nii, beekpee mi ɔblɔ diayɔ ni di dii le di bawa lɛma ladie ni di Egipte diɛbadu ni bia miɛ wɔ mmle.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Diɛkyakaa nii, Manase kafɔɔ lawii ntɔ kpinwu be nitabla ni lɛsalɛsaa, aayɔ mi aayiisa Yerusalem, diayɔ ni di disi le dialaase ni di disi le- diakyakaa ni ku okpile wɔ aata Yuda labla ni suoto, ni baabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Di sɛsaabla bamba di Manase sɛka ole kamɛ ku n-ya amuu aabla ni, aakyakaa ni ku okpile wɔ aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Ni di Manase latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di lɛkayo nɔɔ kɔba kamɛ, Usa kɔba. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Amon layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amon lafũ alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ anyɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyoooto niale Masulemet, Harus wɔ niakye ni Yotba obisankobi aale. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Ni aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu fɛ mmle di ote Manase labla ni nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Aakyɛ di ote sisuku simuu suoto; aasumu afiɔ ya di ote lasumu nii, ni aase katũ kaasɔ aata nya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Aasĩ SAATE, bate nɔɔ Yaa nwu, ni atakyɛ di SAATE nwu sisuku suoto nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Ni di Amon banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ, baalo nwɔ di lɛkayɔ nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Ninfɛ di kasɔ nwu batii lalo batii ba bamuu niataka ni di Ɔka Amon suoto nɛ. Ni baayɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yosia baase ɔka di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Di sɛsaabla bamba se di Amon sɛka ole kamɛ, ku n-ya aabla ni yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Baakookaa nwɔ di ɔkya nɔɔ kamɛ di Usa kɔba kamɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yosia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Yosia lafũ alɛɛ anɛ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Yedida; Adaia wɔ niakye ni Boskat obisankobi aale. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Aabla nle niasiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu, aakyɛ di ote Dawid sisuku simuu suoto, atamunikĩi aafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baanya Kufiofa Kukũ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Di Ɔka Yosia sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ lefosi-nɛnle kamɛ yi, aakpee Mesulam obisuɔtɔbi, Asalia obisuɔtɔbi, Safan wɔ niale ni kukũ kpanatɛ alɛ akyɛ SAATE nwu olekatɛkɔ. Aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Kata fakyɛ faalaatɔkɔ oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Hilkia falɛ asiisa koto ko di n-yoko banyuntɛ lafũ ni di batii nwu ɔkyɛ, baayɔ bawako ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Ayɔ koto nwu aakpee di batii ba baadiki alɛ batoonyu ni olekatakɔ nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla nnɛɛ. Di ɔkpɛ banyuntɛ nwu bayɔ koto nwu bata bakpɛntɛ ba nikololaa ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ. <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />Asaa bawolatɛ, ayo batofotɛ ku afuɔ seyoyiɛ batofotɛ. Ta ma baaya kafɔɔ sewoso ku afuɔ ya beewola babayɔ manlolaa ni olekatakɔ nwu. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ bɛɛkaalɛ ɔkpɛ banyuntɛ nwu bɛɛyɔ koto beekpee ni ninnɛɛ nkuntaa, diekye bɔɔbla di onukwale kanya.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Ni di oletatɛ-nɔɔfo nwu latɔkɔ kukũ kpanatɛ Safan alɛ, “Ntɔɔnya Kufiofa Kukũ nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ.” Ni aayɔ kũ aata Safan, ni aaka kũ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Ninfɛ di kukũ kpanatɛ Safan lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka Yosia alɛ: “Banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ntɔɔyɔ koto ko niate ni di SAATE nwu alekatakɔ beekpee di bakpɛntɛ ku ɔkpɛ banyuntɛ nwu di olekatakɔ nnɛɛ.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Ninfɛ di kukũ kpanatɛ Safan lata ɔka letofo alɛ, “Oletatɛ nwu lɛtɛɛ kukũ kunwii.” Ni di Safan laka kũ di ɔka anu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Obe wɔ di ɔka lanu ni Kufiofa Kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa, ni aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ oletatɛ Hilkia ku Safan obisuɔtɔbi, Ahikam ku Mikaia obisuɔtɔbi, Akbor ku kukũ kpanatɛ Safan ku ɔka kpɛmblatɛ Asaia alɛ: <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Bikyɛ biɛlaawolaa kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ bitɛɛ ku batii nwu ku Yuda omuu di lɛsaa le bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle bɛɛnya ni kamɛ. SAATE nwu nnya ɔblɔ osie kanya ankpeeko wo, diekye bate loo ditakyɔɔ kukũ ko mmle sɛlaa atoko; batabla di sɛlaa se simuu bɛɛkpana ni kanya beefenko ni di suoto loo.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Ni di Hilkia, Ahikam, Akbor, Safan ku Asaia lakyɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ-sanko Hulda wɔ niale ni Harhas obisuɔtɔbi, Tikwa obisuɔtɔbi manlɛɛ ni Salum, ɔsɔfɔ ɔkyɛ nɛ. Nnwɔɔ niale akpeele katɛkɔ nyuntɛ nɛ. Aasiɛ di abaa kale kakyɛ nnyɔɔfa kamɛ di Yerusalem.<verse eid="2KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitɔkɔ osuɔtɔ wɔ niekpee ye ni ɔkyɛ nii bilɛ, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nyu, kamata ɔlaa kpile nwa di lɛba le mmle ku batii nini suoto, di mmle kanya bɛɛkpana ni lɛsaa biala di Yuda ɔka ntɔɔka nii. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Diekye batoosĩ mi, ni beefiɛ olufui bɛɛta bayaa bamba, beekpee mi ɔblɔ ku afiɔ ya amuu bɛɛbla ni ku nnɛɛ lɛma nɛ. Ɔblɔ kamafiɛ mi di lɛba le mmle kunɔmayɔɔ nii.’ <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Bitɔkɔ Yuda ɔka, nnwɔ niekpee ye alɛ bibawolaa ni kamɛ di SAATE nwu nfũ bilɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni, di sɛlaa se bienu ni kanya: <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />Ta mmle di otu lɛfɔ lefũ kuokpee ni, fɛɛwakosa ni suoto lɛfɔ kasɔ di SAATE nwu anu, di obe wɔ feenu ni ɔlaa wɔ lɛkakatɛ ni di lɛba le mmle ku batii nini suoto, alɛ babale ni lɛkpaani, manwɔɔ ni oso, diekye faabɛbɛɛ ni akpeele lɛfɔ, faawi ni kaku di anu nii oso yi, ntoonu fɔ ɔlaa, SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Nioso kamata fɔ fansifi bate lɛfɔ nfũ, mankookaa fɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. Anu lɛfɔ dilɔbanya ɔlaa kpile wɔ kamayɔ nwako ni di lɛba le mmle.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Nioso baayɔ ɔsanko nwu kanya baakyɛnko ɔka.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosia Lase Kanya Ninii Lɛbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lalɛɛ banɔɔfo bamuu di Yuda ku Yerusalem aasiisa nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Ni aakata aasifi SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku Yuda batii, Yerusalem batii, olebatatɛ ku Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nɛ- batii bamuu, diayɔ ni di babisɔ dialaadu ni baanɔɔfo. Ni aaka Kanya Ninii Kukũ nwu baanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ sɛlaa simuu aakpee di atoko lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Ninfɛ di ɔka layila di lɛkpaka ɔlɔɔkɔ aase kanya ninii lese lɛbla di SAATE nwu anu- alɛ abatikanko SAATE nwu, anklee afiofa nɔɔ, anle sɛlaa nɔɔ, ankyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ ku otu nɔɔ omuu ku ɔkla nɔɔ omuu, alɛ ootika difuɔ di kanya ninii sɛlaa se bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ. Ninfɛ di batii nwu bamuu laka suoto lɛma simu ntam baata kanya ninii nwu nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Hilkia ku olebatatɛ ba ninwa ni sɛɛmaa nɔɔ n-yoko banyuntɛ alɛ badiki asaa ya amuu bɛɛbla bɛɛta ni Baal ku afiɔ-sanko Asera ku osi asaa nwu amuu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ nɛ. Ni aafĩɛ asaa nwu di Yerusalem sɛmaa di Kidron Ɔtaata afe kamɛ, aalɛ ntɔ nwu aasifiko Betel nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Aadiɛ bafiɔtɛ olebatatɛ nwu di Yuda baka ladiki alɛ batɔɔfiɛ ni olufui di ntakalekɔ nwu di Yuda sekpoo ku nse niɛmana ni Yerusalem siekyi nii- mba ninfiɛ ni olufui manta ni Baal, kufĩ ku kɔwɛntɛ, awɛntrɛbi ku osi asaa nwu amuu. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Aakyisa Asera afiɔ-sanko nwu owoso di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ aalaatɛ di Kidron Ɔtaata di Yerusalem sɛmaa aafĩɛ nwu ninfa. Aakuɔ nwu kuabla muɛmuɛ, ni aayɔ mpu nwu aawiwii di batii bamuu sɛkya suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Aabibiɛ kafɔɔ nfiofa basɔnɔbakpeetɛ basuɔtɔ ayo ya niawɛ ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛba le di basanko nloso ni abula manta ni Asera afiɔ-sanko nwu.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Ni di Yosia lalɛɛ olebatatɛ bamuu aakyeko Yuda sekpoo nwu aawako, ni aabibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu, diayɔ ni di Geba dialaadu ni Beerseba, aba ya di olebatatɛ nwu lafiɛ ni olufui. Aabibiɛ nfiofa nwu di n-yoko- di kayoko ka nikofe ni okpoo kplɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ, Yosua Kayoko ka ninkpe ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kayoko ɔmɛntukyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Nu di ntakalekɔ nwu olebatatɛ ditabla ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye suoto di Yerusalem yi, baale bloblo wɔ di lɛnyankasaa diesi ni ku olebatatɛ wo lɛma.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Ɔka Yosia kafɔɔ labibiɛ lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Tofet ya niawɛ ni di Ben Hinom Ɔtaata, nioso kuonwii ditasinfuo obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi nɔɔ ɔyɔ ɔta ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ ɔta Molek. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Aabibiɛ bapɔnkɔ ba di Yuda baka lakleklesa baata ni kufĩ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu kayokontũ. Baayila ni di kaflɔnkɔ ka niakaako ni onɔɔfotii onwii manlɛɛ ni Natan-Melek leyo. Ninfɛ di Yosia lafiɛ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni baakleklesa baata ni kufĩ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Ni aakpakpaa ɔleɔta akyikye ya di Yuda baka lasesee ni di lɛkyá le niakaako ni Ahas osi leyo, ku oleɔta akyikye ya di Manase lapɛ ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nflɔnkɔ nwu nnyɔ nɛ. Aakpakpaa nya ninfa, aabibiɛ nya wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ, ni aayɔ mpu nwu aawii di Kidron Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Ɔka Yosia kafɔɔ labibiɛ ntakalekɔ nwu niawɛ ni di Yerusalem kufĩ katunkɔ di Kalalaa Lekpenkpe kala kasɔ- nnya nkpo di Israel ɔka Solomon lapɛ aata ni Sidon batii afiɔ-sanko Astoret diyududusaa nwu ku Moab batii afiɔ Kemos diyududusaa nwu, ku Amon batii afiɔ Milkom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leyooto nwu kafɔɔ ninle Molek nɛ</char></note> diyududusaa nwu. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Yosia labibiɛ afiɔtii nwu aabubudi Asera sewoso, ni aatĩi aba lɛma nwu ku batii akufi nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Bia di oleɔta akyikye ya di Betel, katakalekɔ ka di Nebat, obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam labla ni, aata Israel batii labla ni okpile- bia oleɔta akyikye ya ku katakalekɔ ka aabibiɛ nii. Aafiɛ katakalekɔ nwu, aakuɔ ka aabla mpu, ni aafiɛ Asera owoso kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Ninfɛ di Yosia lanyunyu aafenko, obe wɔ aanya ni sɛkya se niate ni ninfa di lekpenkpe nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ yi, ni aata baadiki akufi nwu di sɛkya nwu kamɛ, ni aafiɛ nya di oleɔta akyikye suoto aakpɔnɔfɔsa nya, di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya, fɛ mmle di Yaa otii nwu labuɛ ni sɛlaa se mmle aatɛ nii nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Ni di ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe ninle ninyumafuɔ nwu kɔnya ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Ninfɛ di okpoo kplɛ nwu batii labuɛ alɛ, “Diotuo Yaa otii wɔ niakye Yuda aawa aabakakatɛ aayila ni di Betel oleɔta akyikye suoto nɛ. Asaa ya mmle nwu nkpo fatɔɔbla fɛɛta nya nɛ.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Ni di Yosia labuɛ alɛ, “Bidiɛ nya ate, kuonwii atankpee akufi nɔɔ kubuɛ.” Nioso baadiɛ Yaa otii nwu akufi ku n-ya niale ni Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niakye ni Samaria akufi late.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Fɛ mmle aabla ni di Betel yi, Yosia lakpakpaa nya, ni aakpɔnɔfɔsa nfiɔfa nwu di ntakalekɔ be mmuu di Israel baka latofo ni di Samaria sekpoo kamɛ baayɔ baakpee ni SAATE nwu ɔblɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Ni di Yosia lalo olebatatɛ bamuu ba di ntakalekɔ nwu di oleɔta akyikye suoto, aafiɛ batii akufi di suoto lɛnya nɛ. Ninfɛ aakple aasifi Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Ni di ɔka latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ: “Bile SAATE nwu Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu, fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Kanya Ninii Kukũ ko mmle kamɛ.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Diayɔ ni di obe wɔ kamɛ di Batunletɛ ba nialeko ni Israel katũ ee di Israel baka ku Yuda baka obe kamɛ yi, batale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii le mmle okle banya. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Kafɔɔ di Ɔka Yosia lɛlɛɛ lefosi-nɛnle kamɛ yi, baale Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii le mmle baata SAATE nwu di Yerusalem.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakyi Ka Bamba Di Yosia Labla Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Diɛkyakaa nii, Yosia labibiɛ sɛbɔ mpɛkɔ, bafatɛ ayo, ayo kamɛ afiɔtii, afiɔ ku ayududusaa bamba ya amuu baanya ni di Yuda ku Yerusalem. Nle mmle aabla alɛ sɛsaabla se di kufiofa ko bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko di oletatɛ Hilkia lanya ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kawa ni kaanya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Ɔka kuonwii ditawɛ fiɛ di Yosia lawa ee aawɛ di sɛmaa nɔɔ fɛle nnwɔɔ okle, aasumu ni SAATE nwu fɛ mmle aabla nii- ku otu nɔɔ omuu ku ɔkla nɔɔ omuu ku osie nɔɔ omuu, di mmle di Mose kufiofa kumuu lebuɛ ni kanya.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu ditadiɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka wɔ aanya ni di Yuda suoto ta asaa ya amuu di Manase labla aakpee ni SAATE nwu ɔblɔ. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Nioso SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kamatososa Yuda kafɔɔ di anu nii, fɛ mmle latososa ni Israel, ninsĩ kafɔɔ Yerusalem, okpoo kplɛ wɔ ladiki nii, ku olekatakɔ ka mmle suoto labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Nfa di Leyooto nii kamate nɛ.’”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Di sɛsaabla bamba di Yosia sɛka ole kamɛ ku n-ya amuu aabla ni yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Obe wɔ di Yosia lale ni ɔka, Egipte ɔka Farao Neko lakata aakyɛ Eufrate Okle aalaakyakaako Asiria ɔka. Ni di Ɔka Yosia ladie aakyɛ aalaakpɛko nwɔ, kafɔɔ Neko lakpɛko nwɔ, ni aalo Yosia di Megiddo nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Ni di Yosia bakpɛmblatɛ layɔ kpi nɔɔ baakpee di keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, baakyeko Megiddo baawako Yerusalem baalaakookaa nwɔ di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ɔkya kamɛ nɛ. Ni di kasɔ nwu batii lamufũ Yosia obisuɔtɔbi, Yehoahas, baapɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ, baase nwɔ ɔka di ote kasiɛkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoahas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehoahas lafũ alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-atiɛ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem awɛntɛ atiɛ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Hamutal, Yeremia obisankobi aale; aakye ni Libna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di bate nɔɔ labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Farao Neko lanii nwɔ sɛkpɛnkyɛ aatɛ di Ribla di Hamat kasɔ suoto, di mmle ɔnɔmale ni sɛka di Yerusalem, ni aatika kokpooto, koto fututu bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana ku koto sɛɛle bakilo afosi-atiɛ-bana aata Yuda nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Ni di Farao Neko layɔ Yosia obisuɔtɔbi, Eliakim aase ɔka di ote Yosia kanya, aakyɛlɛnsa Eliakim leyooto alɛ Yehoiakim. Kafɔɔ aakpaa Yehoahas aasifiko Egipte, nfa aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoiakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoiakim lata Farao Neko koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ko aakaalɛ nii. Ta mmle aafuo ni ɔbla nkpo oso yi, aatika akpooto di kasɔ nwu suoto, aafũ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle aakyeko batii nwu di kasɔ nwu ɔkyɛ di mmle di osie lɛma late ni kanya.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoiakim lafũ alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Sebida, Pedaia obisankobi aale; aakye ni Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Ni aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di bate nɔɔ labla ni nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Di Yehoiakim sɛka ole kamɛ yi, ni di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lataka di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ. Ninfɛ di Yehoiakim labale nwɔ kpɛmblatɛ alɛɛ atiɛ nɛ. Kafɔɔ aakyisa disibu nɔɔ, ni aataka aayila di Nebukadnesar suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu ladiki Babel batii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mma mankple manlɛɛ Kalde batii nɛ </char></note> Siria batii, Moab batii ku Amon batii bayu aakpee Yehoiakim nɛ. Aakpee ma alɛ balaawɔɔsa Yuda, di SAATE nwu bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ, Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ ɔlaa wɔ baabuɛ ni kanya. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Nwaako asaa ya mmle lawa di Yuda suoto di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya, alɛ ookyisa ma di anu nɔɔ, ta Manase sikpile ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />di ntɔ be nintabla ni okpile kuonwii kaasɔ nkyakaa nii. Diekye aata ntɔ be nintabla ni okpile layii Yerusalem, di SAATE nwu kafɔɔ ditatuna alɛ ɔɔyɔ ankyɛ nii.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Di sɛsaabla bamba se di Yehoiakim sɛka ole ku n-ya amuu aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Ni di Yehoiakim latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ, Yehoiakin layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Nioso Egipte ɔka ditasinkple aadie di kale nɔɔ kamu, diekye Babel ɔka layɔ nwɔ kasɔ kamuu, diayɔ ni di Egipte Kaklenyii dialaadu ni Eufrate Okle.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehoiakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoiakin lafũ lefosi alɛɛ anɛ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem awɛntɛ atiɛ. Ɔya niale Nehusta, Elnatan obisankobi aale; aakye ni Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Ni aabla sikpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote labla ni nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar banɔɔfotii nwu ntoodu Yerusalem, bɛɛmana okpoo nwu beekyi, <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />ninfɛ di Nebukadnesar omu lawa okpoo kplɛ nwu, di obe wɔ di banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lamana nwu baakyi ni nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Ni di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakin, ɔya, bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ, batii finle nɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu layɔ suoto lɛma baata Nebukadnesar nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:12">Di Babel ɔka sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ, ni aamufũ Yehoiakin aalaatɛ di leyo katenkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii, Nebukadnesar ladiki lɛsaawɛ le niate ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo nwu, ni aayɔ koto sɛɛle asaa ya di Israel ɔka Solomon labla aata ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Nebukadnesar lakpaa Yerusalem batii bamuu aasifiko bafɔɔ kale: banɔɔfotii bamuu, bakpɛtɛ bamuu, kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ bablatɛ ku abɔɔsaa ɔkpɛ bablatɛ- bamuu labla nkpe lefosi. Batii ba niatɛ baale ni bapiitɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto lete baadiɛ baatɛ.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Nebukadnesar lamufũ Yehoiakin, aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko Babel. Aakpaa kafɔɔ ɔka ɔya, basɔfɔ nɔɔ, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku kasɔ nwu batunletɛ aasifiko. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Mba di Babel ɔka kafɔɔ lasifiko ni Babel niale bakpɛtɛ bamuu ba niawo ni bakpɛtɛ nkpe nkuɛnsĩ, baawɛ ni osie baata ni kakpɛ, kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ bablatɛ ku abɔɔsaa ɔkpɛ bablatɛ kakpe. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Ni di Nebukadnesar layɔ Yehoiakin ote bisɔnle, Matania aabla ɔka di Yehoiakin disi, ni aakyɛlɛnsa leyooto nɔɔ alɛ Sedekia nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Sedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-ninwii di Sedekia lafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Hamutal, Yeremia obisankobi aale; aakye ni Libna. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Aabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, fɛ mmle di Yehoiakim labla nii. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Ta SAATE nwu ɔblɔ oso di n-ya mmle amuu lawa di Yerusalem ku Yuda suoto, ni di kayɛntɛkɔ aakyisa ma di anu nɔɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Kafɔɔ sɛmaa, Sedekia lataka aayila di Babel ɔka suoto.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Kanɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Nioso di lɛlɛɛ naasinle kamɛ di Sedekia sɛka ole kamɛ, di kɔwɛntɛ fosile dii fosile suoto, Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lataka di Yerusalem suoto manko bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu. Aabla kasiɛkɔ di okpoo kplɛ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ, ni baatofo oyoyiɛ baakyisa nwu nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Baamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi dialaadu Ɔka Sedekia sɛka ole lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Di kɔwɛntɛ naafa dii naasinle suoto, kɔka kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie di okpoo kplɛ nwu alɛ alesaa kuanwii ditawɛ di batii nwu kale nii. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Ninfɛ baabiɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu oyoyiɛ, ni di bakpɛtɛ bamuu latoso ku kakyɛ nwu baafe di eyoyiɛ nwu ɛnyɔ obo di kayoko ka ninkaako ni ɔka kɔba, nu di Babel batii lamana okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi. Baatoso baafe di Araba, <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />kafɔɔ Babel batii bakpɛtɛ latikanko ɔka Sedekia baalaamufũ nwɔ di Yeriko ɔtaata. Bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu labla di suoto nɔɔ baasamii, <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />ni baamufũ nwɔ nɛ. Ni baakpaa nwɔ baasifiko Babel ɔka nfũ di Ribla, nfa di Nebukadnesar lalo nwɔ lɛpɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Ni baalo Sedekia babisuɔtɔbi di anu nɔɔ. Ninfɛ baabiɛ nwɔ anu, baakpee nwɔ abɔɔsaa sɛɛle anyɛnɛ, baakpaa nwɔ baasifiko Babel nɛ.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalalaasa SAATE Nwu Olekatakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nɔɔnle dii kuɛsinle, di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar sɛka ole lɛfosi lɛlɛɛ naasinle kamɛ yi, Nebusaradan wɔ niale ni mba ninnyu ni ɔka kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ, aale ni Babel ɔka onɔɔfotii onwii lawa Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Ni aakpee ɔtɔ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, lɛkayo ku ayo ya amuu di Yerusalem nɛ. Aafiɛ leyo finle biala aatɛ kaasɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Babel batii bakpɛtɛ bamuu di ɔka kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ kalɔ labibiɛ oyoyiɛ wɔ niayila kuakyi ni Yerusalem. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Ni di Nebusaradan, banyuntɛ nwu kanyayilatɛ lakpaa batii ba niabu ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu ku babule ba niasiɛ ni ninfa ku mba niasifi ni di Babel ɔka nfũ aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Kafɔɔ kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu ladiɛ batii ba di dipii latɛ diaklee ni di kasɔ nwu suoto alɛ bakpɛ afe ku nta awosobi afe.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Babel batii labibiɛ abɔɔsaa sɛɛle akpaka ku atikasaa ya mankyisa ni ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle Lekpo babɛɛsi ba niawɛ ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ, ni baayɔ abɔɔsaa nwu baasifiko Babel nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Baayɔ kafɔɔ abukii, basoofi, kandiɛ sikũ ayiensasaa, nsɛfɛ ku abɔɔsaa asaa ya amuu baayɔ baatɔɔblako ni ɔkpɛ di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Ɔka banyuntɛ nwu kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ layɔ olufui afiɛsaa ku babɛɛsi- asaa ya amuu baayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa ee koto fututu nwaa baabla ni aasifiko.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Abɔɔsaa akpaka nwu anyɔ, Lɛkpo bɛɛsi, ku atikasaa ya mankyisa ni ya di Solomon labla aata ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lasii onutũ ɔwɛ baakadi nii. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Osi ditikasaa di lɛkpaka biala suoto lɛtaka labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ. Abɔɔsaa sanale di lɛkpaka ninwii osi lɛtaka labla nkpaa nna ku kakuu. Ni aabla abɔɔsaa awosobi ya ninte ni fɛle goowa aalososaa aatika aakyisa nimuu nɛ. Akpaka bule ku aalososaa nwu okle late fɛ nnya nkpo.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakpaa Yuda Batii Baasifiko Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Banyuntɛ nwu kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu lamufũ oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Seraia ku Sefania, oletatɛ wɔ niatikanko nwɔ ni ku kayoko banyuntɛ batiɛ aalaatɛ di leyo kantenkɔ. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Di mba niakple baawɛ ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ yi, aakpaa ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ niayila ni di bakpɛtɛ kanya ku mba ninkakatɛ manta ni ɔka banɔɔ aasifiko. Aakpaa kafɔɔ kukũ kpanatɛ wɔ niale ni ɔnɔɔfotii-nɔɔfo wɔ niayila ni kaanya aatoofũ ni kasɔ nwu batii di bakpɛtɛ kamɛ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ afosi-akuɔ ba baanya ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Ni di kanyayilatɛ Nebusaradan lakpaa bamuu lɛma aawako Babel ɔka di Ribla nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lata baalo ma di Ribla, di Hamat kasɔ suoto nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:21">Nioso baakpaa Yuda baadieko di kasɔ nɔɔ baasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedalia Labale Abaa Kanyayilatɛ Di Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Ni di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ladiki Safan obisuɔtɔbi, Ahikam obisuɔtɔbi, Gedalia alɛ ayila di batii ba aadiɛ aatɛ ni di Yuda kanya nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Obe wɔ di bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma lanu alɛ Babel ɔka ntoodiki Gedalia eese ni fɛ abaa kanyayilatɛ yi, ni baawa Gedalia nfũ di Mispa nɛ. Mma niale Netania obisuɔtɔbi, Ismael, Karea obisuɔtɔbi, Yohanan, Tanhumet, Netofa otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Seraia, Maakat otii nwu obisuɔtɔbi Yaasania, ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Ni di Gedalia laka ntam aata ma ku bakpɛtɛ lɛma alɛ, “Bitanyɛkɛ Babel banɔɔfotii nwu, bisiɛ di kasɔ nwu, biesumu Babel ɔka nwu, ni dibalɛ ninta ye.”<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Kafɔɔ di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ, Elisama obisuɔtɔbi, Netania obisuɔtɔbi, Ismael wɔ niakye ni ɔka leyo kamɛ lawa ku basuɔtɔ lefosi baabalo Gedalia ku Yuda batii ku Babel batii ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Mispa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Ta nle mmle oso, batii nwu bamuu, diayɔ ni di obisɔ dialaase ni di ɔnɔɔfo, di bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfotii nwu lakyaakaa ni latoso baasifi Egipte, ta baatɔɔyɛkɛ ni Babel batii oso.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Yehoiakin Di Leyo Katenkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Di alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-dikuɛsinle kamɛ di Yuda ɔka Yehoiakin lasiɛ ni di bafɔɔ kale, di Ewil-Merodak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mankple manlɛɛ nwɔ alɛ Amel-Marduk nɛ</char></note> labale ni Babel ɔka yi, ni aadiki Yehoiakin di leyo katenkɔ di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa, afosi-anyɔ dii dikuɛsinle suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Ewil-Merodak lakakatɛko nwɔ buɛɛ, ni aatɔɔ dibu kasiɛkɔ ka niataka katoo kaalenkee ni baka ba niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Babel nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Nioso Yehoiakin ladiki leyo katenkɔ aakpeele nɔɔ aatɛ, ni di obe lele di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu kamɛ, aatoole alesaa di ɔka opunu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Dii biala ɔka latɔɔta Yehoiakin koto di obe wɔ akpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>